<div class="content-card" style="padding: 0; background: transparent; border: none; box-shadow: none;"><div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.85) 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 32px; margin-bottom: 24px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);"><div style="position: absolute; right: -40px; top: -40px; width: 220px; height: 220px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;"></div><div style="position: absolute; right: 120px; bottom: -50px; width: 180px; height: 180px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%); border-radius: 50%; pointer-events: none;"></div><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; position: relative; z-index: 2;"><div style="max-width: 780px;"><div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span style="width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #38bdf8; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #38bdf8;"></span><span style="font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;"> Bahasa Pemrograman Generasi Baru &bull; Berbahasa Indonesia </span></div><h1 style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 10px 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><span> DapCode </span><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #818cf8); color: #fff; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px;"> v{{ $version }}</span><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> 100% Rust Toolchain </span></h1><p style="font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin: 0 0 18px 0; line-height: 1.6;"> Bahasa pemrograman tingkat tinggi modern, aman, dan efisien dengan sintaks bersih <strong> tanpa titik koma (*semicolon-free*) </strong> yang terinspirasi oleh Kotlin & Python, dipadukan dengan kata kunci ekspresif berbahasa Indonesia. Dilengkapi <strong> Inferensi Tipe Hindley-Milner </strong> , manajemen memori <strong> Perceus Auto-Ownership (Zero GC) </strong> , <strong> WebAssembly & PWA Mobile Bundler </strong> , serta <strong> transpilasi ke C99 native </strong> . </p><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><a href="#playground" class="dap-btn-primary" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #2563eb); color: #fff; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.4); transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Coba Interactive Playground </a><a href="#downloads" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); color: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.15)); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; transition: background 0.2s;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Unduh Toolchain & Extension </a><a href="#docs" style="background: transparent; color: #38bdf8; padding: 10px 14px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Dokumentasi Lengkap &rarr; </a></div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; min-width: 280px;"><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;"><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin-bottom: 2px;"> Tingkat Bahasa </div><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> Tingkat Tinggi </div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;"> (High-Level Systems) </div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;"><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin-bottom: 2px;"> Manajemen Memori </div><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #34d399;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Zero-GC Auto </div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;"> (Perceus Ownership) </div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;"><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin-bottom: 2px;"> Target Kompilasi </div><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b;"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Multi-Target </div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;"> Native C99, WASM, PWA </div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.08)); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px;"><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin-bottom: 2px;"> Keamanan Pointer </div><div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #ec4899;"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Zero Null-Safety </div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;"> Inferred Error Union </div></div></div></div></div><div id="playground" style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;"><div><h2 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 4px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i></span> Live Playground & Simulator Interaktif </h2><p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin: 0;"> Ketik atau modifikasi kode DapCode di bawah dan rasakan langsung sensasi mengeksekusinya tanpa perlu instalasi terlebih dahulu! </p></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><label for="templateSelector" style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #38bdf8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Contoh Template: </label><select id="templateSelector" onchange="loadDapcodeTemplate(this.value)" style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.9); color: #fff; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; outline: none; min-width: 240px;"><option value="hello"> 🌟 1. Halo Dunia & Tipe Data </option><option value="walrus"> ⚡ 2. Walrus & Inferensi Tipe </option><option value="error_union"> 🛡️ 3. Error Union (T ! E) & Null Safety </option><option value="struct_trait"> 📦 4. Struktur, Sifat & Metoda </option><option value="daftar_loop"> 📋 5. Koleksi Dinamis & Loop untuk-di </option><option value="kamus"> 🗄️ 6. Kamus (Hash Map Key-Value) </option><option value="canvas"> 🎨 7. Grafis Kanvas 2D Interaktif </option><option value="json_http"> 🌐 8. Client HTTP & JSON Serializer </option><option value="crypto_regex"> 🔍 9. Kriptografi (SHA256) & Regex </option><option value="tests"> 🧪 10. Test Runner Mandiri (uji & pastikan) </option><option value="concurrency"> ⏱️ 11. Konkurensi Coroutine Colorless </option><option value="input_io"> ⌨️ 12. Input Interaktif Terminal (masukan &amp; baca_baris) </option></select></div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;" class="dap-playground-grid"><div style="background: #0b1120; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 8px 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="display: flex; gap: 5px;"><span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ef4444; display: inline-block;"></span><span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #f59e0b; display: inline-block;"></span><span style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #10b981; display: inline-block;"></span></span><span id="activeFileName" style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> utama.dap </span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><button type="button" onclick="resetEditorCode()" title="Reset ke kode awal template" style="background: transparent; border: none; color: #94a3b8; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-rotate-left"></i> Reset </button><button type="button" onclick="copyEditorCode()" title="Salin kode sumber ke clipboard" style="background: transparent; border: none; color: #94a3b8; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i> Salin </button><button type="button" onclick="downloadEditorCode()" title="Unduh berkas .dap ini" style="background: transparent; border: none; color: #94a3b8; cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 11px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Simpan .dap </button></div></div><div style="position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 360px; display: flex;"><div id="editorLineNumbers" style="width: 40px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); color: #475569; padding: 12px 6px 12px 0; text-align: right; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; user-select: none; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);"> 1 </div> <textarea id="dapEditor" spellcheck="false" oninput="updateLineNumbers()" onkeydown="handleEditorTab(event)" style="flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; color: #e2e8f0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; padding: 12px; outline: none; resize: none; width: 100%; white-space: pre; overflow-x: auto;"></textarea> </div><div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 6px 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b;"><span> Bahasa: <strong> DapCode (.dap) </strong> &bull; Tanpa Titik Koma </span><span id="editorStats"> Baris: 1 &bull; Karakter: 0 </span></div></div><div style="background: #0b1120; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 8px 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-terminal" style="color: #34d399; font-size: 12px;"></i><span style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600;"> Terminal Keluaran (dapcodec run) </span></div><div id="executionBadge" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 11px; color: #34d399; font-weight: 600;"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #34d399;"></span> Siap Dijalankan </div></div><div id="terminalOutput" style="flex: 1; min-height: 380px; padding: 14px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: #38bdf8; background: #060b13; overflow-y: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;"> Klik tombol [Jalankan Kode] di bawah untuk mengeksekusi program melalui kompilator resmi DapCode! 💡 Petunjuk Cepat: - Ubah nilai variabel di editor sebelah kiri. - Pilih contoh template untuk melihat ragam fitur DapCode. - Kode akan langsung dievaluasi dan menampilkan keluaran secara instan. </div><div id="terminalInteractiveBar" style="display: none; background: #0c1527; border-top: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4); padding: 8px 12px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; box-shadow: 0 -4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex: 1; min-width: 180px;"><span style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; flex-shrink: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-terminal" style="font-size: 11px; color: #34d399;"></i><span id="interactivePromptLabel" style="max-width: 160px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;" title="Prompt Input"> Ketik masukan: </span></span><input type="text" id="terminalInteractiveInput" placeholder="Ketik nilai lalu tekan [Enter]..." autocomplete="off" onkeydown="if(event.key === 'Enter') { event.preventDefault(); submitTerminalInput(); }" style="flex: 1; min-width: 0; width: 100%; background: #030712; border: 1px solid #38bdf8; color: #f8fafc; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; outline: none; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);"></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0;"><button type="button" id="btnSubmitInteractiveInput" onclick="submitTerminalInput()" title="Kirim masukan ke terminal (Enter)" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); color: #fff; border: none; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11.5px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.15s;"><span> Kirim (Enter) </span><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-turn-down fa-rotate-90" style="font-size: 10px;"></i></button><button type="button" onclick="cancelInteractiveSession()" title="Batalkan Sesi Interaktif" style="background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2); color: #fca5a5; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11.5px; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i></button></div></div><div id="canvasPreviewContainer" style="display: none; padding: 12px; background: #020617; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); text-align: center;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 600;"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-palette"></i> Canvas 2D WebAssembly Live Preview: </span><span style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 10px;"> 600 x 320 px </span></div><canvas id="dapCanvas" width="600" height="300" style="background: #0f172a; border: 1px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 8px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);"></canvas></div><div style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 8px 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;"><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8;"><span id="timingLabel"> Waktu Eksekusi: - </span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><button type="button" onclick="clearTerminal()" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i> Bersihkan </button><button type="button" id="btnRunCode" onclick="runDapCode()" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669); color: #fff; border: none; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4); transition: transform 0.15s;"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Jalankan Kode (Live Runner) </button></div></div></div></div><div style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-fork"></i> Sisipkan Snippet Cepat: </span><button type="button" onclick="insertSnippet('fungsi')" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;"> + Fungsi </button><button type="button" onclick="insertSnippet('struktur')" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;"> + Struktur </button><button type="button" onclick="insertSnippet('error_union')" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;"> + Error Union (T ! E) </button><button type="button" onclick="insertSnippet('uji')" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: #fff; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;"> + Blok Uji </button></div><div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted);"> Server Runner: <span style="color: {{ $binAvailable ? '#34d399' : '#f59e0b' }}; font-weight: 600;">{{ $binAvailable ? 'Aktif (dapcodec native)' : 'Simulator Web Browser' }}</span></div></div></div><div id="downloads" style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 30px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px;"><div><h2 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 4px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); color: #34d399; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i></span> Pusat Unduhan & Instalasi Multi-Platform </h2><p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin: 0;"> Dapatkan kompilator resmi DapCode untuk sistem operasi pilihan Anda atau pasang ekstensi resmi di VS Code / Antigravity IDE. </p></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i> Kompilator: v{{ $version }}</span><span style="background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); color: #34d399; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.25); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece"></i> IDE Extension: v{{ $extensionVersion }}</span></div></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 24px;" class="dap-download-grid"><div style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; overflow: hidden;"><div style="position: absolute; right: -15px; top: -15px; width: 70px; height: 70px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); border-radius: 50%;"></div><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 26px; color: #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-brands fa-windows"></i></span><span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;"> Windows 10/11 x64 </span></div><h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"> Windows Installer </h3><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.5;"> Instal otomatis via PowerShell dalam 1 detik atau unduh biner langsung (.exe) dan berkas arsip .zip lengkap. </p><div style="background: #020617; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; position: relative;"><div style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;"> One-Line PowerShell (Rekomendasi): </div> <code style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #38bdf8; word-break: break-all; display: block;">irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dapcode/dapcode-lang/master/scripts/install.ps1 | iex</code> <button type="button" onclick="copyText('irm https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dapcode/dapcode-lang/master/scripts/install.ps1 | iex')" style="position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: none; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i></button></div></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><a href="{{ $downloads['windows_exe']['url'] }}" class="dap-btn-primary" style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background: #0284c7; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> dapcodec.exe ({{ $downloads['windows_exe']['size'] }}) </a><a href="{{ $downloads['windows_zip']['url'] }}" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;" title="Unduh Bundel ZIP"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-zipper"></i> ZIP </a></div></div><div style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; overflow: hidden;"><div style="position: absolute; right: -15px; top: -15px; width: 70px; height: 70px; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08); border-radius: 50%;"></div><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 26px; color: #f59e0b;"><i class="fa-brands fa-linux"></i><i class="fa-brands fa-apple" style="font-size: 24px; color: #e2e8f0; margin-left: 6px;"></i></span><span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color: #f59e0b; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;"> Linux & macOS </span></div><h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"> Linux & macOS (Bash / zsh) </h3><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.5;"> Pemasangan satu baris skrip curl untuk Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Arch Linux, dan macOS Apple Silicon & Intel. </p><div style="background: #020617; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; position: relative;"><div style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;"> One-Line Terminal: </div> <code style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #f59e0b; word-break: break-all; display: block;">curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dapcode/dapcode-lang/master/scripts/install.sh | bash</code> <button type="button" onclick="copyText('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dapcode/dapcode-lang/master/scripts/install.sh | bash')" style="position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: none; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i></button></div></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><a href="{{ $downloads['linux_script']['url'] }}" class="dap-btn-primary" style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background: #d97706; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> install.sh ({{ $downloads['linux_script']['size'] }}) </a></div></div><div style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; position: relative; overflow: hidden;"><div style="position: absolute; right: -15px; top: -15px; width: 70px; height: 70px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); border-radius: 50%;"></div><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 26px; color: #34d399;"><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece"></i></span><span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.15); color: #34d399; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px;"> VS Code & Antigravity </span></div><h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"> IDE Extension (.vsix) </h3><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 0 0 14px 0; line-height: 1.5;"> Ekstensi resmi: Pewarnaan Sintaks, LSP Completion, Real-time Diagnostics, Live Canvas 2D Playground, dan Ekspor Mobile PWA. </p><div style="background: #020617; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-bottom: 14px; position: relative;"><div style="font-size: 10px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 4px;"> Perintah Instalasi CLI: </div> <code style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #34d399; word-break: break-all; display: block;">code --install-extension dapcode-lang-0.7.3.vsix</code> <button type="button" onclick="copyText('code --install-extension dapcode-lang-0.7.3.vsix')" style="position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border: none; color: #fff; font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fa-solid fa-copy"></i></button></div></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px;"><a href="{{ $downloads['vscode_extension']['url'] }}" class="dap-btn-primary" style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background: #059669; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Unduh VSIX v{{ $extensionVersion }} ({{ $downloads['vscode_extension']['size'] }}) </a></div></div></div><div style="background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" style="color: #38bdf8;"></i> Verifikasi Setelah Pemasangan </h4><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; font-size: 12.5px;" class="dap-verify-grid"><div style="background: #020617; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><div style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 4px;"> 1. Periksa Versi Toolchain: </div> <code style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: monospace;">dapcodec --version</code> </div><div style="background: #020617; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><div style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 4px;"> 2. Buka Konsol Interaktif: </div> <code style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: monospace;">dapcodec repl</code> </div><div style="background: #020617; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);"><div style="color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 4px;"> 3. Jalankan Berkas Program: </div> <code style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: monospace;">dapcodec run program.dap</code> </div></div></div></div><div id="docs" style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border: 1px solid var(--border-color, rgba(255,255,255,0.1)); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><h2 style="font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 4px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.2); color: #818cf8; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-bookmark"></i></span> Dokumentasi & Panduan Menyeluruh DapCode </h2><p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted, #94a3b8); margin: 0;"> Pelajari konsep fundamental, paradigma sintaksis, penanganan galat aman, hingga kompilasi WebAssembly dan Mobile PWA. </p></div><div style="margin-bottom: 22px; background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" style="color: #38bdf8; font-size: 16px;"></i><input type="text" id="docSearchInput" oninput="filterDocTopics(this.value)" placeholder="Ketik kata kunci pencarian (misal: variabel, aritmatika, logika, jika, selama, fungsi, parameter, input output, regex, mobile, unit test, repl)..." style="flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; outline: none; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 13.5px; font-family: inherit;"><span style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px; white-space: nowrap;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt" style="color: #facc15;"></i> 8 Modul Lengkap </span></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none;" id="docTabs"><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn active" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-syntax-variables', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-cube"></i> 1. Sintaks, Variabel &amp; Tipe </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-operators', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i> 2. Operator Aritmatika &amp; Logika </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-control-flow', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> 3. Percabangan &amp; Perulangan </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-functions', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-gears"></i> 4. Fungsi &amp; Parameter </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-error-oop', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-virus"></i> 5. Error Union &amp; OOP </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-io-reference', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-keyboard"></i> 6. Kamus Lengkap I/O &amp; Berkas </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-regex-mobile', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen"></i> 7. Regex, Mobile &amp; Kanvas 2D </button><button type="button" class="dap-tab-btn" onclick="switchDocTab('tab-testing-repl', this)"><i class="fa-solid fa-vial-circle-check"></i> 8. Unit Test, REPL &amp; CLI </button></div><div id="tab-syntax-variables" class="dap-tab-pane active doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 1 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Sintaks Fundamental, Titik Masuk 'fungsi utama()' &amp; Sistem Variabel </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Selamat datang di DapCode! Modul ini dirancang khusus bagi Anda yang baru pertama kali memulai pemrograman. Pelajari bagaimana menulis variabel yang bersih, aturan titik masuk program utama, memahami cara kompiler menebak tipe data secara otomatis, serta aturan ketat keamanan memori tanpa galat null. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #f59e0b40; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-door-open"></i> Aturan Wajib DapCode: Titik Masuk 'fungsi utama()' </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Seperti halnya bahasa sistem modern Go (<code>func main()</code>), Rust (<code>fn main()</code>), dan C (<code>int main()</code>), semua baris instruksi yang dieksekusi (deklarasi variabel, operasi aritmatika, perulangan, pemanggilan <code>cetak</code>) <strong> wajib berada di dalam fungsi </strong> , dengan <strong> <code>fungsi utama() { ... }</code> </strong> sebagai gerbang utama program. <br> Pernyataan langsung di luar fungsi hanya boleh berupa deklarasi (<code>fungsi</code>, <code>struktur</code>, <code>sifat</code>, <code>terapkan</code>, atau <code>uji</code>). Jika Anda menulis baris kode langsung di luar fungsi, kompiler akan memberikan pesan: <em> 'Diharapkan deklarasi ('impor', 'uji', 'struktur', 'sifat', 'terapkan', atau 'fungsi')' </em> . </div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #38bdf840; border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i> Mengapa Deklarasi Variabel Tidak Membutuhkan Tipe Data Eksplisit? </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> DapCode menggunakan teknologi <strong> Type Inference (Penyimpulan Tipe Statis) </strong> . Kompiler secara cerdas memeriksa nilai di sisi kanan operator <code>:=</code> pada saat kompilasi. Anda mendapatkan kemudahan sintaksis yang seringkas Python/JavaScript, namun tetap mempertahankan <strong> kecepatan kompilasi native dan keandalan tipe 100% </strong> seperti di Rust atau Go. Sekali dideklarasikan dengan tipe tertentu, variabel tersebut terikat statis dan tidak bisa diisi tipe lain secara sembarangan. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #ef444440; border-left: 4px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Bagaimana Jika Mendeklarasikan Variabel Tanpa Nilai (Uninitialized)? </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Di DapCode, <strong> variabel tanpa nilai awal dilarang keras </strong> oleh kompiler demi keamanan memori. Mengizinkan variabel kosong adalah penyebab utama <em> undefined behavior </em> , bug memori acak, dan crash <em> null pointer </em> di bahasa lama. Anda <strong> wajib </strong> menginisialisasi variabel dengan nilai default (misalnya angka <code>0</code>, desimal <code>0.0</code>, teks <code>""</code>, boolean <code>salah</code>, atau koleksi <code>Daftar()</code>), atau gunakan tipe hasil <strong> Error Union (<code>Nilai ! Galat</code>) </strong> jika nilainya baru akan diproses kemudian. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Sintaks Variabel: Deklarasi (:=) &amp; Penugasan (=) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Wajib berada di dalam fungsi utama(). Gunakan := saat pertama kali membuat variabel, dan = saat mengubah nilai. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Deklarasi & Mutasi Variabel di DapCode\nfungsi utama() {\n nama := \"Daffa\" // Deklarasi baru menggunakan :=\n umur := 21 // Tipe otomatis disimpulkan sebagai u64\n tinggi := 172.5 // Tipe desimal (f64)\n aktif := benar // Boolean (benar atau salah)\n\n cetak(\"Halo, nama saya {nama}\")\n cetak(\"Umur saya: {umur} tahun\")\n cetak(\"Tinggi badan: {tinggi} cm\")\n\n // Mengubah nilai variabel yang sudah ada (reassignment)\n umur = 22 // Cukup gunakan operator =\n cetak(\"Ulang tahun! Umur sekarang: {umur} tahun\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Deklarasi & Mutasi Variabel di DapCode
fungsi utama() {
    nama := "Daffa"            // Deklarasi baru menggunakan :=
    umur := 21                 // Tipe otomatis disimpulkan sebagai u64
    tinggi := 172.5            // Tipe desimal (f64)
    aktif := benar             // Boolean (benar atau salah)

    cetak("Halo, nama saya {nama}")
    cetak("Umur saya: {umur} tahun")
    cetak("Tinggi badan: {tinggi} cm")

    // Mengubah nilai variabel yang sudah ada (reassignment)
    umur = 22                  // Cukup gunakan operator =
    cetak("Ulang tahun! Umur sekarang: {umur} tahun")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan format snake_case untuk nama variabel dan interpolasi string {variabel} saat mencetak ke layar. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Koleksi Data Bawaan: Daftar &amp; Kamus (Map) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> DapCode menyediakan konstruktor koleksi Daftar(...) dan Kamus() yang efisien dan aman memori. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Eksplorasi Tipe Primitif & Koleksi Data\nfungsi utama() {\n // Angka Bulat & Desimal\n saldo_awal := 500000\n bunga_bank := 0.075\n\n // Koleksi Daftar (Array Dinamis menggunakan Daftar(...))\n hobi := Daftar(\"Koding\", \"Membaca\", \"Musik\")\n cetak(\"Jumlah hobi: {hobi.panjang()}\")\n hobi.tambah(\"Bermain Game\")\n cetak(\"Daftar hobi: {hobi.gabung(\", \")}\")\n\n // Koleksi Kamus (Pasangan Kunci-Nilai menggunakan Kamus())\n profil := Kamus()\n profil.pasang(\"role\", \"Software Engineer\")\n profil.pasang(\"kota\", \"Jakarta\")\n \n role := profil.ambil_atau(\"role\", \"-\")\n kota := profil.ambil_atau(\"kota\", \"-\")\n cetak(\"Role pekerjaan: {role}\")\n cetak(\"Domisili: {kota}\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Eksplorasi Tipe Primitif & Koleksi Data
fungsi utama() {
