="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>u64</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Numerik </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Integer bulat tanpa tanda (0 s/d 18.4 triliun). Default: <code>0</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>skor := 100</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>i64</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Numerik </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Integer bulat bertanda negatif & positif. Default: <code>0</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>suhu := -15</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>desimal</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Numerik </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Bilangan pecahan / floating-point 64-bit IEEE 754. Default: <code>0.0</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>pi := 3.14159</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>Teks</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Tekstual </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Untaian teks string UTF-8 aman memori. Default: <code>""</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>judul := "DapCode"</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>Boolean</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Logika </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Nilai logika kebenaran: <code>benar</code> atau <code>salah</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>aktif := benar</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>Karakter</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Primitif Tekstual </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Satu karakter unicode tunggal. Default: <code>'\0'</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>huruf := 'A'</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>Daftar</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Koleksi Dinamis </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Array sekuensial yang ukuran panjangnya elastis. Inisialisasi: <code>Daftar(...)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>angka := Daftar(1, 2, 3)</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>Kamus</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Koleksi Asosiatif </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Peta pasangan kunci dan nilai (Map / Dictionary). Inisialisasi: <code>Kamus()</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>data := Kamus()</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>T ! E</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Error Union </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Tipe gabungan antara nilai sukses <code>T</code> atau galat <code>E</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>hitung() -> u64 ! Teks</code> </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id="tab-operators" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2); color: #c084fc; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 2 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Operator Aritmatika, Logika Boolean &amp; Urutan Operasi (Precedence) </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Kuasai perhitungan matematika, logika kondisi, tabel kebenaran, serta bagaimana kompiler menentukan urutan eksekusi ekspresi dengan tanda kurung dan prioritas operator. </p></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Operasi Aritmatika Dasar &amp; Modulo </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Wajib di dalam fungsi utama(). Hitung penjumlahan, perkalian, hingga sisa bagi modulo (%) untuk kalkulasi siklis. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Eksplorasi Operator Aritmatika & Modulo\nfungsi utama() {\n a := 25\n b := 7\n\n cetak(\"Nilai a: {a}, b: {b}\")\n cetak(\"Penjumlahan (a + b) = {a + b}\")\n cetak(\"Pengurangan (a - b) = {a - b}\")\n cetak(\"Perkalian (a * b) = {a * b}\")\n cetak(\"Pembagian (a / b) = {a / b}\") // Pembagian bulat\n\n // Modulo (%) sangat berguna untuk cek ganjil/genap\n sisa := a % b\n cetak(\"Sisa Bagi (a % b) = {sisa}\")\n\n angka := 14\n jika angka % 2 == 0 {\n cetak(\"{angka} adalah bilangan GENAP\")\n } selain_itu {\n cetak(\"{angka} adalah bilangan GANJIL\")\n }\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Eksplorasi Operator Aritmatika & Modulo
fungsi utama() {
    a := 25
    b := 7

    cetak("Nilai a: {a}, b: {b}")
    cetak("Penjumlahan (a + b) = {a + b}")
    cetak("Pengurangan (a - b) = {a - b}")
    cetak("Perkalian   (a * b) = {a * b}")
    cetak("Pembagian   (a / b) = {a / b}")   // Pembagian bulat

    // Modulo (%) sangat berguna untuk cek ganjil/genap
    sisa := a % b
    cetak("Sisa Bagi   (a % b) = {sisa}")

    angka := 14
    jika angka % 2 == 0 {
        cetak("{angka} adalah bilangan GENAP")
    } selain_itu {
        cetak("{angka} adalah bilangan GANJIL")
    }
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Operator pembagian '/' pada integer menghasilkan pembagian bulat tanpa koma. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Logika Pembanding &amp; Evaluasi Hubung Singkat </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Gabungkan beberapa kondisi logika dengan &amp;&amp; (DAN), || (ATAU), dan ! (TIDAK). </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Eksplorasi Operator Logika & Short-Circuit\nfungsi utama() {\n umur := 20\n punya_sim := benar\n ada_tilang := salah\n\n // Operator Logika DAN (&&), ATAU (||), TIDAK (!)\n boleh_mengemudi := (umur > = 17) && punya_sim\n cetak(\"Boleh mengemudi: {boleh_mengemudi}\")\n\n kena_denda := ada_tilang || (!punya_sim)\n cetak(\"Kena denda: {kena_denda}\")\n\n // Contoh Short-Circuit Evaluation:\n // Jika syarat pertama salah, syarat kedua tidak akan dievaluasi sama sekali!\n saldo := 150000\n harga_barang := 80000\n stok_tersedia := 5\n\n bisa_beli := (stok_tersedia > 0) && (saldo >= harga_barang)\n jika bisa_beli {\n cetak(\"Transaksi BERHASIL! Saldo mencukupi.\")\n } selain_itu {\n cetak(\"Transaksi GAGAL.\")\n }\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Eksplorasi Operator Logika & Short-Circuit
fungsi utama() {
    umur := 20
    punya_sim := benar
    ada_tilang := salah

    // Operator Logika DAN (&&), ATAU (||), TIDAK (!)
    boleh_mengemudi := (umur >= 17) && punya_sim
    cetak("Boleh mengemudi: {boleh_mengemudi}")

    kena_denda := ada_tilang || (!punya_sim)
    cetak("Kena denda: {kena_denda}")

    // Contoh Short-Circuit Evaluation:
    // Jika syarat pertama salah, syarat kedua tidak akan dievaluasi sama sekali!
    saldo := 150000
    harga_barang := 80000
    stok_tersedia := 5

    bisa_beli := (stok_tersedia > 0) && (saldo >= harga_barang)
    jika bisa_beli {
        cetak("Transaksi BERHASIL! Saldo mencukupi.")
    } selain_itu {
        cetak("Transaksi GAGAL.")
    }
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan tanda kurung ( ) agar urutan pengecekan logika Anda tidak ambigu. </div></div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #a855f740; border-left: 4px solid #a855f7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #a855f7; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Prinsip Short-Circuit Evaluation (Evaluasi Hubung Singkat) </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Dalam ekspresi <code>A &amp;&amp; B</code>, jika <code>A</code> bernilai <code>salah</code>, maka kompiler DapCode <strong> tidak akan pernah menjalankan atau mengevaluasi B </strong> , karena hasil akhirnya sudah pasti <code>salah</code>. Begitu pula pada <code>A || B</code>, jika <code>A</code> bernilai <code>benar</code>, sisi <code>B</code> akan diabaikan. Fitur ini sangat krusial untuk mencegah crash saat memeriksa kondisi berantai (misalnya memastikan data ada sebelum mengakses propertinya). </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i> Kamus Operator Aritmatika &amp; Penugasan </h4><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Operator </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Nama Simbol </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Contoh Operasi </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Hasil </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Keterangan </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>+</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Penjumlahan </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>10 + 5</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>15</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menjumlahkan dua bilangan atau menggabungkan dua teks (konkatenasi). </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>-</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Pengurangan </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>10 - 4</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>6</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengurangkan nilai atau menyatakan bilangan negatif (unary minus). </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>*</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Perkalian </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>6 * 7</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>42</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengalikan dua bilangan numerik. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>/</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Pembagian </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>20 / 4</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>5</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membagi dua bilangan. Pembagian dengan nol dicegah kompiler. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>%</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Modulo / Sisa Bagi </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>17 % 5</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>2</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menghasilkan sisa bilangan dari pembagian bulat. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>+=</code>, <code>-=</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Penugasan Gabungan </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>skor += 10</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Nilai bertambah </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menyingkat penulisan <code>skor = skor + 10</code>. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>*=</code>, <code>/=</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Penugasan Perkalian </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>saldo *= 2</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Nilai berlipat </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menyingkat penulisan <code>saldo = saldo * 2</code>. </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #34d399; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells"></i> Tabel Kebenaran Logika (Truth Table) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 12px 0;"> Panduan standar evaluasi nilai kebenaran logika boolean: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Operand A </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Operand B </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> A && B (DAN) </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> A || B (ATAU) </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> !A (TIDAK A) </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>benar</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>benar</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;'> benar </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;'> benar </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171;'> salah </span></td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>benar</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>salah</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171; font-weight: 700;'> salah </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;'> benar </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171;'> salah </span></td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>salah</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>benar</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171; font-weight: 700;'> salah </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399; font-weight: 700;'> benar </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399;'> benar </span></td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>salah</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>salah</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171; font-weight: 700;'> salah </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #f87171; font-weight: 700;'> salah </span></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><span style='color: #34d399;'> benar </span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f59e0b; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down-1-9"></i> Hirarki Prioritas Operator (Precedence) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 12px 0;"> Urutan eksekusi oleh kompiler jika tidak ada tanda kurung: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Prioritas </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Kategori Operator </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Simbol Operator </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Arah Evaluasi (Asosiatif) </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 1 (Tertinggi) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Grup Tanda Kurung </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>( ... )</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Dari Dalam ke Luar </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 2 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Unary Negasi </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>!</code>, <code>-</code> (minus negatif) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kanan ke Kiri </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 3 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Multiplikasi </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>%</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 4 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Adisi / Penjumlahan </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>+</code>, <code>-</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 5 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Perbandingan Nilai </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 6 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kesetaraan </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>==</code>, <code>!=</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 7 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Logika Konjungsi (DAN) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>&amp;&amp;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan (Short-circuit) </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 8 </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Logika Disjungsi (ATAU) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>||</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kiri ke Kanan (Short-circuit) </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> 9 (Terendah) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Penugasan Nilai </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>=</code>, <code>+=</code>, <code>-=</code>, <code>*=</code>, <code>/=</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kanan ke Kiri </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><div id="tab-control-flow" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 3 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Alur Kendali: Percabangan, Perulangan &amp; Komparasi Lintas Bahasa </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Bandingkan alur kendali logika program dari bahasa yang mungkin pernah Anda pelajari (C, Java, Python, PHP, JavaScript) ke dalam paradigma DapCode yang bersih, ringkas, dan bebas jebakan bug. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-compare"></i> Tabel Komparasi Komprehensif: Bahasa Lain vs DapCode </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 14px 0;"> Tabel referensi cepat untuk memetakan logika percabangan dan perulangan favorit Anda: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Konsep Kontrol </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Sintaks di Bahasa Lain (C, Java, Python, PHP, JS) </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Sintaks Idiomatis DapCode </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Keunggulan di DapCode </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> If Tunggal </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>if (kondisi) { ... }</code> (C/Java/JS/PHP) <br> <code>if kondisi: ...</code> (Python) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>jika kondisi { ... }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Tanpa tanda kurung wajib pada kondisi, blok kurung kurawal <code>{ }</code> wajib untuk mencegah bug dangling-else. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> If - Else </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>if (kondisi) { } else { }</code> (C/Java) <br> <code>if: ... else: ...</code> (Python) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>jika kondisi { } selain_itu { }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kata kunci ramah dan natural berbahasa Indonesia, blok terisolasi dengan rapi. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> If - Else If - Else </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>else if</code> (C/Java/PHP) <br> <code>elif</code> (Python) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>jika ... selain_itu jika ... selain_itu { }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Konsisten dan mudah dibaca secara manusiawi tanpa singkatan membingungkan. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> While Loop </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>while (kondisi) { ... }</code> (C/Java/PHP/JS) <br> <code>while kondisi:</code> (Python) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>selama kondisi { ... }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Kondisi dievaluasi sebelum blok dijalankan, berhenti otomatis saat kondisi menjadi <code>salah</code>. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Foreach Koleksi </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>for (item of list)</code> (JS) <br> <code>foreach ($list as $item)</code> (PHP) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>untuk item di daftar { ... }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Iterasi sekuensial aman memori tanpa perlu mengakses indeks array manual. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Do - While Loop </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>do { ... } while (kondisi);</code> (C/Java/PHP/JS) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>selama benar { ... jika !kondisi { berhenti } }</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menjamin blok dijalankan minimal 1 kali dengan pola perulangan yang dihentikan oleh kata kunci <code>berhenti</code>. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Hentikan Loop (Break) </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>break;</code> (C/Java/Python/PHP/JS) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>berhenti</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Langsung keluar dari loop terdalam secara instan. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Lompati Putaran (Continue) </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>continue;</code> (C/Java/Python/PHP/JS) </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>lanjut</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Melompat langsung ke evaluasi iterasi putaran berikutnya. </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #10b98140; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch"></i> Filosofi Alur Kendali di DapCode </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Di DapCode, semua pernyataan kontrol (<code>jika</code>, <code>selain_itu</code>, <code>selama</code>, <code>untuk</code>) <strong> wajib menggunakan kurung kurawal <code>{ }</code> </strong> . Desain ini mengeliminasi kesalahan fatal dalam rekayasa perangkat lunak seperti <em> goto fail bug </em> (Apple SSL bug) di mana programmer melewatkan baris akibat ketiadaan tanda kurung kurawal pada blok satu baris. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Percabangan jika / selain_itu jika / selain_itu </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Wajib di dalam fungsi utama(). Gunakan 'jika' untuk evaluasi bersyarat multi-tingkat. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Percabangan Bersyarat: jika, selain_itu jika, selain_itu\nfungsi utama() {\n skor := 85\n\n jika skor > = 90 {\n cetak(\"Predikat: A (Istimewa)\")\n } selain_itu jika skor >= 80 {\n cetak(\"Predikat: B (Sangat Baik)\")\n } selain_itu jika skor >= 70 {\n cetak(\"Predikat: C (Cukup)\")\n } selain_itu {\n cetak(\"Predikat: D (Perlu Belajar Lagi)\")\n }\n\n // Pengecekan kondisi genap atau ganjil\n bilangan := 14\n jika bilangan % 2 == 0 {\n cetak(\"{bilangan} adalah bilangan GENAP\")\n } selain_itu {\n cetak(\"{bilangan} adalah bilangan GANJIL\")\n }\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Percabangan Bersyarat: jika, selain_itu jika, selain_itu
fungsi utama() {
    skor := 85

    jika skor >= 90 {
        cetak("Predikat: A (Istimewa)")
    } selain_itu jika skor >= 80 {
        cetak("Predikat: B (Sangat Baik)")
    } selain_itu jika skor >= 70 {
        cetak("Predikat: C (Cukup)")
    } selain_itu {
        cetak("Predikat: D (Perlu Belajar Lagi)")
    }

    // Pengecekan kondisi genap atau ganjil
    bilangan := 14
    jika bilangan % 2 == 0 {
        cetak("{bilangan} adalah bilangan GENAP")
    } selain_itu {
        cetak("{bilangan} adalah bilangan GANJIL")
    }
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Kompiler DapCode mengevaluasi kondisi dari atas ke bawah dan mengeksekusi blok pertama yang bernilai benar. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Perulangan selama (while) &amp; untuk di Daftar (for-each) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Lakukan pengulangan otomatis berbasis kondisi, koleksi data, maupun simulasi do-while. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Perulangan: selama (while) & untuk di Daftar (for-each)\nfungsi utama() {\n // Perulangan 1: selama (While Loop)\n cetak(\"--- Hitung Mundur Roket ---\")\n detik := 3\n selama detik > 0 {\n cetak(\"Meluncur dalam: {detik}...\")\n detik = detik - 1\n }\n cetak(\"Luncurkan! \ud83d\ude80\")\n\n // Perulangan 2: untuk di koleksi Daftar\n cetak(\"--- Iterasi Koleksi Data ---\")\n menu := Daftar(\"Nasi Goreng\", \"Mie Ayam\", \"Sate Ayam\")\n untuk makanan di menu {\n cetak(\"Menu Tersedia: {makanan}\")\n }\n\n // Perulangan 3: Simulasi Do-While (Blok dijalankan minimal 1 kali)\n cetak(\"--- Simulasi Do-While di DapCode ---\")\n percobaan := 0\n selama benar {\n percobaan += 1\n cetak(\"Mencoba koneksi ke server, percobaan ke-{percobaan}\")\n \n // Syarat selesai (kondisi keluar loop)\n jika percobaan >= 3 {\n cetak(\"Koneksi berhasil terhubung!\")\n berhenti // Keluar dari perulangan\n }\n }\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Perulangan: selama (while) & untuk di Daftar (for-each)
fungsi utama() {
    // Perulangan 1: selama (While Loop)
    cetak("--- Hitung Mundur Roket ---")
    detik := 3
    selama detik > 0 {
        cetak("Meluncur dalam: {detik}...")
        detik = detik - 1
    }
    cetak("Luncurkan! 🚀")

    // Perulangan 2: untuk di koleksi Daftar
    cetak("--- Iterasi Koleksi Data ---")
    menu := Daftar("Nasi Goreng", "Mie Ayam", "Sate Ayam")
    untuk makanan di menu {
        cetak("Menu Tersedia: {makanan}")
    }

    // Perulangan 3: Simulasi Do-While (Blok dijalankan minimal 1 kali)
    cetak("--- Simulasi Do-While di DapCode ---")
    percobaan := 0
    selama benar {
        percobaan += 1
        cetak("Mencoba koneksi ke server, percobaan ke-{percobaan}")
        
        // Syarat selesai (kondisi keluar loop)
        jika percobaan >= 3 {
            cetak("Koneksi berhasil terhubung!")
            berhenti     // Keluar dari perulangan
        }
    }
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan 'berhenti' untuk keluar paksa dari loop, dan 'lanjut' untuk melewati putaran saat ini. </div></div></div></div><div id="tab-functions" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 4 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Penulisan Fungsi, Manajemen Parameter &amp; Rekursi </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Pelajari cara menstrukturkan kode menjadi fungsi yang dapat digunakan kembali, memahami kontrak tipe parameter, hingga teknik pemrograman rekursif yang aman. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #0284c740; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #0284c7; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Aturan Penulisan Parameter & Return Type di DapCode </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Berbeda dengan variabel lokal yang tipenya disimpulkan secara otomatis melalui <code>:=</code>, parameter pada fungsi <strong> wajib menyertakan tipe data eksplisit </strong> (seperti <code>nama: Teks, umur: u64</code>). Hal ini sengaja dirancang agar fungsi bertindak sebagai kontrak publik yang jelas, aman dari kesalahan pemanggilan, dan memudahkan dokumentasi otomatis tanpa ambiguitas. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Definisi Fungsi Dasar &amp; Prosedur (Unit) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Deklarasikan fungsi dengan kata kunci 'fungsi', parameter bertipe, dan panggil di dalam fungsi utama(). </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Anatomi Fungsi: Parameter, Nilai Kembalian, & Prosedur\n// A. Fungsi dengan nilai kembalian (menggunakan tanda -> Tipe)\nfungsi hitung_diskon(harga: desimal, persen: desimal) -> desimal {\n potongan := harga * (persen / 100.0)\n kembali harga - potongan\n}\n\n// B. Prosedur (Fungsi aksi tanpa nilai kembalian / Unit)\nfungsi sapa_pengguna(nama: Teks, role: Teks) {\n cetak(\"Selamat datang, {nama}!\")\n cetak(\"Hak akses Anda saat ini: {role}\")\n}\n\n// C. Titik Masuk Utama Eksekusi\nfungsi utama() {\n sapa_pengguna(\"Daffa\", \"Administrator\")\n\n harga_awal := 250000.0\n harga_akhir := hitung_diskon(harga_awal, 20.0)\n cetak(\"Harga setelah diskon 20%: Rp {harga_akhir}\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Anatomi Fungsi: Parameter, Nilai Kembalian, & Prosedur
// A. Fungsi dengan nilai kembalian (menggunakan tanda -> Tipe)
fungsi hitung_diskon(harga: desimal, persen: desimal) -> desimal {
    potongan := harga * (persen / 100.0)
    kembali harga - potongan
}

// B. Prosedur (Fungsi aksi tanpa nilai kembalian / Unit)
fungsi sapa_pengguna(nama: Teks, role: Teks) {
    cetak("Selamat datang, {nama}!")
    cetak("Hak akses Anda saat ini: {role}")
}

// C. Titik Masuk Utama Eksekusi
fungsi utama() {
    sapa_pengguna("Daffa", "Administrator")

    harga_awal := 250000.0
    harga_akhir := hitung_diskon(harga_awal, 20.0)
    cetak("Harga setelah diskon 20%: Rp {harga_akhir}")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan kata kunci 'kembali' untuk mengembalikan nilai ke pemanggil fungsi. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Banyak Parameter &amp; Fungsi Rekursif </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Kirim beberapa parameter ke fungsi atau panggil fungsi secara rekursif. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Parameter Koleksi & Fungsi Rekursif\n// A. Fungsi Rekursi: Menghitung Faktorial dengan Kasus Dasar\nfungsi faktorial(n: u64) -> u64 {\n jika n <= 1 {\n kembali 1\n }\n kembali n * faktorial(n - 1)\n}\n\n// B. Fungsi dengan Banyak Parameter Perhitungan\nfungsi hitung_volume_balok(panjang: desimal, lebar: desimal, tinggi: desimal) -> desimal {\n kembali panjang * lebar * tinggi\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n // Memanggil fungsi rekursif\n hasil_faktorial := faktorial(5)\n cetak(\"5 Faktorial (5!) = {hasil_faktorial}\")\n\n // Menghitung volume balok\n p := 10.0\n l := 5.0\n t := 2.5\n volume := hitung_volume_balok(p, l, t)\n cetak(\"Volume Balok (10x5x2.5): {volume} m3\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Parameter Koleksi & Fungsi Rekursif
// A. Fungsi Rekursi: Menghitung Faktorial dengan Kasus Dasar
fungsi faktorial(n: u64) -> u64 {
    jika n <= 1 {
        kembali 1
    }
    kembali n * faktorial(n - 1)
}

// B. Fungsi dengan Banyak Parameter Perhitungan
fungsi hitung_volume_balok(panjang: desimal, lebar: desimal, tinggi: desimal) -> desimal {
    kembali panjang * lebar * tinggi
}

fungsi utama() {
    // Memanggil fungsi rekursif
    hasil_faktorial := faktorial(5)
    cetak("5 Faktorial (5!) = {hasil_faktorial}")

    // Menghitung volume balok
    p := 10.0
    l := 5.0
    t := 2.5
    volume := hitung_volume_balok(p, l, t)
    cetak("Volume Balok (10x5x2.5): {volume} m3")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Pastikan fungsi rekursif selalu memiliki kondisi penghenti (base case) agar tidak terjadi perulangan tanpa henti. </div></div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i> Klasifikasi Ragam Fungsi di DapCode </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 14px 0;"> Berikut rangkuman struktur fungsi yang didukung kompiler DapCode: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Jenis Parameter </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Contoh Deklarasi Fungsi </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Deskripsi & Cara Kerja </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Parameter Tunggal </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>fungsi kuadrat(x: u64) -> u64</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menerima 1 argumen bertipe integer <code>u64</code> dan mengembalikan hasil kuadrat. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Banyak Parameter </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>fungsi luas(p: desimal, l: desimal) -> desimal</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menerima 2 atau lebih argumen yang dipisahkan dengan tanda koma. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Fungsi Prosedur (Unit) </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>fungsi sapa(nama: Teks)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Prosedur aksi murni yang tidak menghasilkan nilai kembalian (mirip <code>void</code> di C/Java). </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Fungsi Rekursif </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>fungsi faktorial(n: u64) -> u64</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Fungsi yang memanggil dirinya sendiri dengan kondisi penghenti (base case) yang jelas. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Titik Masuk (Entry Point) </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>fungsi utama()</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Fungsi utama tanpa parameter yang pertama kali dipanggil oleh kompiler saat program dijalankan. </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id="tab-error-oop" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 5 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Sistem Error Union (Nilai ! Galat) &amp; OOP Berbasis Struktur </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Membangun aplikasi tingkat industri yang tangguh dari crash tanpa overhead blok try-catch kuno, serta mengorganisir data dan logika bisnis menggunakan paradigma struktur berorientasi objek. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #10b98140; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i> Filosofi Zero-Panic: Tanpa 'Null' & Tanpa 'Try-Catch' Lambat </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Pencipta istilah <em> Null Pointer Exception </em> menyebutnya sebagai 'kesalahan satu miliar dolar'. Di DapCode, <strong> tidak ada nilai null </strong> . Setiap fungsi yang mungkin gagal wajib mendeklarasikan tipe galatnya secara eksplisit dalam tandatangan fungsi (<code>Tipe ! Galat</code>). Anda tidak perlu khawatir aplikasi crash mendadak di tengah produksi, karena kompiler akan memaksa programmer untuk menangani setiap kemungkinan galat sebelum program selesai dikompilasi. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Error Union &amp; Penanganan Galat (? tangkap) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Tangani potensi kesalahan secara eksplisit dengan nilai fallback yang aman tanpa mematikan program. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Penanganan Galat Modern: Error Union (Nilai ! Galat)\nfungsi bagi_aman(a: u64, b: u64) -> u64 ! Teks {\n jika b == 0 {\n gagal \"Pembagian dengan nol dilarang dalam matematika!\"\n }\n a / b\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n // Menangkap galat dengan aman menggunakan: ? tangkap err { ... }\n hasil := bagi_aman(100, 0) ? tangkap pesan_error {\n cetak(\"Peringatan Sistem: {pesan_error}\")\n 0 // Nilai fallback yang aman\n }\n\n cetak(\"Hasil pembagian yang diproses: {hasil}\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Penanganan Galat Modern: Error Union (Nilai ! Galat)
fungsi bagi_aman(a: u64, b: u64) -> u64 ! Teks {
    jika b == 0 {
        gagal "Pembagian dengan nol dilarang dalam matematika!"
    }
    a / b
}

fungsi utama() {
    // Menangkap galat dengan aman menggunakan: ? tangkap err { ... }
    hasil := bagi_aman(100, 0) ? tangkap pesan_error {
        cetak("Peringatan Sistem: {pesan_error}")
        0    // Nilai fallback yang aman
    }

    cetak("Hasil pembagian yang diproses: {hasil}")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan kata kunci 'gagal' untuk membatalkan proses dan mengirimkan pesan kesalahan terstruktur. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Struktur Data OOP &amp; Instansiasi Objek </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Kelompokkan entitas bisnis ke dalam model struktur dan akses properti objek secara instan. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Pemrograman Berorientasi Objek (OOP): Struktur & Instansiasi\nstruktur RekeningBank {\n nomor_rekening: Teks\n pemilik: Teks\n saldo: f64\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n // Instansiasi objek baru dengan sintaksis bernama\n tabungan := RekeningBank(\n nomor_rekening: \"DAP-8829-01\",\n pemilik: \"Daffa\",\n saldo: 500000.0\n )\n\n cetak(\"=== BUKU TABUNGAN ===\")\n cetak(\"Nasabah : {tabungan.pemilik}\")\n cetak(\"No. Rek : {tabungan.nomor_rekening}\")\n cetak(\"Saldo : Rp{tabungan.saldo}\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Pemrograman Berorientasi Objek (OOP): Struktur & Instansiasi
struktur RekeningBank {
    nomor_rekening: Teks
    pemilik: Teks
    saldo: f64
}

fungsi utama() {
    // Instansiasi objek baru dengan sintaksis bernama
    tabungan := RekeningBank(
        nomor_rekening: "DAP-8829-01",
        pemilik: "Daffa",
        saldo: 500000.0
    )

    cetak("=== BUKU TABUNGAN ===")
    cetak("Nasabah : {tabungan.pemilik}")
    cetak("No. Rek : {tabungan.nomor_rekening}")
    cetak("Saldo   : Rp{tabungan.saldo}")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Instansiasi struktur menggunakan tanda kurung NamaStruktur(properti: nilai). </div></div></div></div><div id="tab-io-reference" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 6 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Kamus Lengkap Input / Output (I/O), Berkas Disk &amp; Sistem Operasi </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Kamus lengkap fungsi I/O standar: cara berinteraksi dengan terminal, menerima masukan keyboard secara langsung, membaca dan menulis dokumen berkas ke disk, hingga mengakses variabel lingkungan OS. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #38bdf840; border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-keyboard"></i> Interaktivitas Keyboard Terminal & Penanganan File I/O </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Di DapCode, fungsi <code>masukan(prompt)</code> secara otomatis menampilkan pesan panduan dan menunggu masukan dari keyboard pengguna sebelum melanjutkan baris kode berikutnya. Pada editor web di atas, konsol interaktif akan terbuka secara otomatis saat Anda menjalankan kode yang memuat <code>masukan()</code>. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Terminal I/O Interaktif: masukan() &amp; Transformasi Teks </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Wajib di dalam fungsi utama(). Minta input pengguna secara interaktif dan tampilkan hasil olahan. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Masukan & Keluaran Interaktif (Terminal I/O)\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"=== KONSOL INTERAKTIF DAPCODE ===\")\n\n // Mengambil input teks dari pengguna dengan prompt interaktif\n nama := masukan(\"Masukkan nama lengkap Anda : \")\n peran := masukan(\"Masukkan peran / profesi : \")\n kota := masukan(\"Masukkan kota domisili : \")\n\n nama_kapital := ke_huruf_besar(nama)\n total_karakter := panjang_teks(nama)\n\n cetak(\"----------------------------------------\")\n cetak(\"Salam kenal, {nama_kapital}!\")\n cetak(\"Detail Profil: Peran [{peran}] di kota [{kota}]\")\n cetak(\"Panjang karakter nama: {total_karakter} karakter.\")\n cetak(\"----------------------------------------\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Masukan & Keluaran Interaktif (Terminal I/O)
fungsi utama() {
    cetak("=== KONSOL INTERAKTIF DAPCODE ===")

    // Mengambil input teks dari pengguna dengan prompt interaktif
    nama := masukan("Masukkan nama lengkap Anda : ")
    peran := masukan("Masukkan peran / profesi   : ")
    kota := masukan("Masukkan kota domisili     : ")

    nama_kapital := ke_huruf_besar(nama)
    total_karakter := panjang_teks(nama)

    cetak("----------------------------------------")
    cetak("Salam kenal, {nama_kapital}!")
    cetak("Detail Profil: Peran [{peran}] di kota [{kota}]")
    cetak("Panjang karakter nama: {total_karakter} karakter.")
    cetak("----------------------------------------")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Playground web akan membuka bar input interaktif di bawah terminal saat mendeteksi masukan(). </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. File I/O: Menulis, Membaca &amp; Menghapus Berkas </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Simpan catatan teks langsung ke media penyimpanan fisik dengan penanganan galat. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Kamus Manipulasi Berkas Disk (File I/O)\nfungsi utama() {\n nama_berkas := \"catatan_dapcode.txt\"\n konten := \"Hari ini saya mulai memprogram dengan DapCode!\nBahasa aman, cepat, dan modern.\"\n\n // 1. Menulis berkas ke disk\n cetak(\"Menyimpan berkas '{nama_berkas}'...\")\n tulis_berkas(nama_berkas, konten) ? tangkap err {\n cetak(\"Gagal menulis berkas: {err}\")\n kembali\n }\n cetak(\"Berkas berhasil disimpan ke disk!\")\n\n // 2. Memeriksa keberadaan berkas\n ada := ada_berkas(nama_berkas)\n cetak(\"Apakah berkas ditemukan? {ada}\")\n\n // 3. Membaca kembali isi berkas\n cetak(\"Membaca kembali isi berkas:\")\n isi := baca_berkas(nama_berkas) ? tangkap err {\n cetak(\"Gagal membaca berkas: {err}\")\n kembali\n }\n cetak(isi)\n\n // 4. Menghapus berkas contoh\n hapus_berkas(nama_berkas) ? tangkap err {\n cetak(\"Gagal menghapus: {err}\")\n kembali\n }\n cetak(\"Pembersihan berkas sementara selesai.\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Kamus Manipulasi Berkas Disk (File I/O)
fungsi utama() {
    nama_berkas := "catatan_dapcode.txt"
    konten := "Hari ini saya mulai memprogram dengan DapCode!
Bahasa aman, cepat, dan modern."

    // 1. Menulis berkas ke disk
    cetak("Menyimpan berkas '{nama_berkas}'...")
    tulis_berkas(nama_berkas, konten) ? tangkap err {
        cetak("Gagal menulis berkas: {err}")
        kembali
    }
    cetak("Berkas berhasil disimpan ke disk!")

    // 2. Memeriksa keberadaan berkas
    ada := ada_berkas(nama_berkas)
    cetak("Apakah berkas ditemukan? {ada}")

    // 3. Membaca kembali isi berkas
    cetak("Membaca kembali isi berkas:")
    isi := baca_berkas(nama_berkas) ? tangkap err {
        cetak("Gagal membaca berkas: {err}")
        kembali
    }
    cetak(isi)

    // 4. Menghapus berkas contoh
    hapus_berkas(nama_berkas) ? tangkap err {
        cetak("Gagal menghapus: {err}")
        kembali
    }
    cetak("Pembersihan berkas sementara selesai.")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Fungsi berkas mengembalikan Error Union sehingga wajib diamankan dengan '? tangkap' atau operator '?'. </div></div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-atlas"></i> Kamus Referensi Fungsi Input / Output &amp; Berkas DapCode </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 14px 0;"> Semua fungsi di bawah ini merupakan fungsi pustaka standar bawaan tanpa perlu mengimpor library luar: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Fungsi / Perintah </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Tipe Parameter & Nilai Kembalian </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Deskripsi & Perilaku </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Contoh Penggunaan </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cetak(nilai)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(nilai: ApaSaja) -> Unit</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menampilkan data ke layar terminal (stdout) diakhiri dengan baris baru otomatis. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cetak("Halo Dunia")</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>masukan(prompt)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(prompt: Teks) -> Teks</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menampilkan teks prompt dan membaca masukan string dari keyboard terminal. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>nama := masukan("Nama: ")</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>baca_baris()</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>() -> Teks</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membaca masukan seluruh baris dari stdin termasuk spasi hingga tombol Enter ditekan. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>alamat := baca_baris()</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>panjang_teks(str)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(str: Teks) -> u64</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menghitung jumlah karakter teks string. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>len := panjang_teks(str)</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ke_huruf_besar(str)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(str: Teks) -> Teks</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengubah seluruh karakter teks menjadi huruf kapital (UPPERCASE). </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>up := ke_huruf_besar(nama)</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ke_huruf_kecil(str)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(str: Teks) -> Teks</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengubah seluruh karakter teks menjadi huruf kecil (lowercase). </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>low := ke_huruf_kecil(str)</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ada_berkas(path)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(path: Teks) -> Boolean</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Memeriksa apakah berkas ada di media penyimpanan disk. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ada := ada_berkas("file.txt")</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>baca_berkas(path)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(path: Teks) -> Teks ! Galat</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membaca seluruh isi berkas teks dari disk lokal. Mengembalikan Galat jika berkas tidak ada. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>isi := baca_berkas("app.log")?</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>tulis_berkas(path, data)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(path: Teks, data: Teks) -> Boolean ! Galat</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membuat berkas baru atau menimpa (overwrite) isi berkas di disk secara aman. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>tulis_berkas("out.txt", "OK")?</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>hapus_berkas(path)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(path: Teks) -> Boolean ! Galat</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menghapus berkas dari sistem penyimpanan secara permanen. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>hapus_berkas("temp.tmp")?</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ambil_lingkungan(kunci)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(kunci: Teks) -> Teks ! Galat</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membaca nilai variabel lingkungan (environment variable) sistem operasi. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>port := ambil_lingkungan("PORT")?</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ambil_argumen_cli()</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>() -> Daftar[Teks]</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengambil daftar argumen command line yang diteruskan ke program saat startup. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>args := ambil_argumen_cli()</code> </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div id="tab-regex-mobile" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section">
