                    <i class="fa-brands fa-android" style="font-size: 16px;"></i> Target Android (APK / AAB via NDK CMake)
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">
                    Folder <code>android/</code> berisi proyek Android Studio siap pakai dengan <strong>CMakeLists.txt</strong>, <strong>GLSurfaceView</strong> berkelanjutan, dan bridge JNI ke <code>dapcode_engine.c</code>.
                </p>
                <div style="background: #020617; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <span style="color: #64748b;"># 1. Buka folder android/ di Android Studio</span><br>
                    <span style="color: #64748b;"># 2. Atau kompilasi biner via terminal:</span><br>
                    cd android<br>
                    ./gradlew assembleDebug<br>
                    <span style="color: #34d399;"># Hasil APK Debug:</span><br>
                    <span style="color: #94a3b8;">app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk</span><br><br>
                    <span style="color: #64748b;"># Untuk rilis Google Play Store (AAB):</span><br>
