                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">
                    Folder <code>ios/</code> menyediakan <strong>DapCodeViewController.m</strong> yang mengelola konteks <code>EAGLContext</code> 60 FPS dan menghubungkan event layar sentuh ke GPU engine.
                </p>
                <div style="background: #020617; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 8px;">
                    <span style="color: #64748b;"># 1. Buka proyek di Xcode pada macOS</span><br>
                    <span style="color: #64748b;"># 2. Framework tertaut: OpenGLES &amp; GLKit</span><br>
