                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><code>(r: f64, g: f64, b: f64, a: f64)</code></td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;">Mengatur warna outline atau garis goresan (stroke color).</td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><code>kanvas_warna_garis(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 0.5)</code></td>
