                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #38bdf8; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><code>kanvas_lingkaran</code></td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><code>(cx: f64, cy: f64, rad: f64)</code></td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;">Menggambar lingkaran padat berpusat di (cx, cy) dengan jari-jari rad.</td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><code>kanvas_lingkaran(50.0, 50.0, 20.0)</code></td>
