    <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <h4 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-asterisk"></i> Kamus Fungsi Regular Expression (Regex) Bawaan DapCode
        </h4>
        <p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 14px 0;"> Semua fungsi pencocokan pola regex didukung secara native tanpa ketergantungan library pihak ketiga: </p>
        <div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);">
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);">
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Fungsi Regex </th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Tipe Parameter &amp; Return </th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Kegunaan &amp; Perilaku </th>
                        <th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Contoh Penggunaan </th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'">
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cocok_regex(pola, teks)</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(pola: Teks, data: Teks) -&gt; Boolean</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengecek apakah teks mematuhi pola regex tertentu. </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cocok_regex("^[0-9]+$", "123")</code> </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'">
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cari_regex(pola, teks)</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(pola: Teks, data: Teks) -&gt; Daftar[Teks]</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menemukan seluruh bagian kata/substring yang cocok dengan pola. </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>cari_regex("\\b[A-Z]+\\b", str)</code> </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'">
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ganti_regex(pola, teks, baru)</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(pola: Teks, data: Teks, baru: Teks) -&gt; Teks</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengganti semua teks yang cocok dengan string baru pengganti. </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ganti_regex("\\d+", str, "***")</code> </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'">
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>pisah_regex(pola, teks)</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(pola: Teks, data: Teks) -&gt; Daftar[Teks]</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Memecah teks menjadi array daftar berdasarkan delimiter pola regex. </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>pisah_regex("[,;]", baris)</code> </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'">
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>ekstrak_regex(pola, teks)</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(pola: Teks, data: Teks) -&gt; Teks ! Galat</code> </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengambil kemunculan pertama pola regex atau mengembalikan galat. </td>
                        <td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>id := ekstrak_regex("\\d+", log)?</code> </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
