<div id="tab-testing-repl" class="dap-tab-pane doc-section"><div style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><span style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2); color: #34d399; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;"> MODUL 8 </span><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> Kerangka Unit Testing, Terminal REPL &amp; Perintah Kompiler CLI </h3></div><p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;"> Tingkatkan produktivitas pemrograman Anda menggunakan konsol REPL untuk eksplorasi instan, lakukan verifikasi mutu kode otomatis dengan Unit Test bawaan, serta kuasai perintah-perintah CLI pada kompiler <code>dapcodec</code>. </p></div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7); border: 1px solid #10b98140; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-vial-circle-check"></i> Mengapa Unit Test Penting untuk Programmer Pemula? </div><div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55;"> Saat program Anda semakin besar, mengubah satu baris kode berisiko merusak fitur lain yang sudah berjalan sebelumnya (dikenal sebagai <em> regresi bug </em> ). Dengan menulis blok <code>uji { pastikan_sama(...) }</code>, Anda dapat memverifikasi ribuan baris kode hanya dalam hitungan milidetik menggunakan perintah <code>dapcodec test</code>. Ini adalah standar profesional di dunia rekayasa perangkat lunak modern. </div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 1. Blok Unit Test: uji, pastikan_sama &amp; pastikan </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Tulis pengujian unit langsung di dalam berkas kode Anda tanpa perlu menginstal framework pengujian luar. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 1. Kerangka Unit Testing Bawaan DapCode (uji & pastikan)\nfungsi hitung_pajak(penghasilan: f64) -> f64 {\n jika penghasilan <= 50000000.0 {\n penghasilan * 0.05\n } selain_itu {\n penghasilan * 0.15\n }\n}\n\n// Blok Pengujian Unit 1: Memastikan batas tarif rendah 5%\nuji \"validasi tarif pajak penghasilan rendah\" {\n pajak := hitung_pajak(40000000.0)\n pastikan_sama(pajak, 2000000.0)\n}\n\n// Blok Pengujian Unit 2: Memastikan tarif di atas batas 15%\nuji \"validasi tarif pajak penghasilan di atas batas\" {\n pajak := hitung_pajak(100000000.0)\n pastikan_sama(pajak, 15000000.0)\n}\n\n// Titik masuk utama\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"Semua blok uji siap diuji dengan perintah: dapcodec test\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 1. Kerangka Unit Testing Bawaan DapCode (uji & pastikan)
fungsi hitung_pajak(penghasilan: f64) -> f64 {
    jika penghasilan <= 50000000.0 {
        penghasilan * 0.05
    } selain_itu {
        penghasilan * 0.15
    }
}

// Blok Pengujian Unit 1: Memastikan batas tarif rendah 5%
uji "validasi tarif pajak penghasilan rendah" {
    pajak := hitung_pajak(40000000.0)
    pastikan_sama(pajak, 2000000.0)
}

// Blok Pengujian Unit 2: Memastikan tarif di atas batas 15%
uji "validasi tarif pajak penghasilan di atas batas" {
    pajak := hitung_pajak(100000000.0)
    pastikan_sama(pajak, 15000000.0)
}

// Titik masuk utama
fungsi utama() {
    cetak("Semua blok uji siap diuji dengan perintah: dapcodec test")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Jalankan 'dapcodec test nama_berkas.dap' di terminal untuk menjalankan semua blok uji secara otomatis. </div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 8px; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap;"><div><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 4px 0;"> 2. Konsol REPL Interaktif: Eksplorasi Ekspresi Cepat </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;"> Eksplorasi sintaks, cek tipe data, dan uji coba perhitungan matematika instan tanpa menyimpan file. </p></div><button type="button" onclick='loadSnippetToPlayground("/// 2. Simulasi Evaluasi Interaktif REPL (Read-Eval-Print Loop)\n// Buka terminal / command prompt Anda dan ketik: dapcodec repl\n// Anda dapat langsung mengetik ekspresi dan melihat hasilnya seketika:\n\n// [REPL] > 10 * 5 + 25\n// => 75 (u64)\n\n// [REPL] > nama := \"Daffa\"\n// => \"Daffa\" (Teks)\n\n// [REPL] > cocok_regex(\"^[A-Z]+$\", \"DAPCODE\")\n// => benar (Boolean)\n\n// [REPL] > :bantuan\n// Menampilkan panduan navigasi dan perintah REPL bawaan\n\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"Jalankan 'dapcodec repl' di Terminal untuk membuka konsol interaktif!\")\n}")' style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); color: #38bdf8; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.25)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='rgba(56,189,248,0.15)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" style="font-size: 9px;"></i> Muat ke Editor </button></div> <pre style="background: #030712; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%;"><code>/// 2. Simulasi Evaluasi Interaktif REPL (Read-Eval-Print Loop)
// Buka terminal / command prompt Anda dan ketik: dapcodec repl
// Anda dapat langsung mengetik ekspresi dan melihat hasilnya seketika:

// [REPL] > 10 * 5 + 25
// => 75 (u64)

// [REPL] > nama := "Daffa"
// => "Daffa" (Teks)

// [REPL] > cocok_regex("^[A-Z]+$", "DAPCODE")
// => benar (Boolean)

// [REPL] > :bantuan
// Menampilkan panduan navigasi dan perintah REPL bawaan

fungsi utama() {
    cetak("Jalankan 'dapcodec repl' di Terminal untuk membuka konsol interaktif!")
}</code></pre> <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #38bdf8;"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i> Gunakan pintasan tanda panah Atas dan Bawah di keyboard untuk menelusuri riwayat perintah REPL sebelumnya. </div></div></div><div class="dap-two-col" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;"><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #38bdf8; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-terminal"></i> Kamus Perintah Bawaan Konsol REPL </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 12px 0;"> Daftar perintah internal yang diawali tanda titik dua (<code>:</code>) pada sesi REPL: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Perintah REPL </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Sintaks Masukan </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Deskripsi Aksi </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Bantuan </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>:bantuan</code> atau <code>:h</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menampilkan panduan singkat daftar perintah dan tips navigasi. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Cek Tipe </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>:tipe &lt;ekspresi&gt;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menganalisis dan menampilkan tipe data hasil ekspresi tanpa mengeksekusinya. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Muat Berkas </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>:muat &lt;nama_file.dap&gt;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengimpor seluruh fungsi dan variabel dari berkas luar ke dalam sesi REPL. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Bersihkan </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>:bersihkan</code> atau <code>:clear</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membersihkan teks riwayat di layar terminal interaktif. </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"><strong> Keluar Sesi </strong></td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>:keluar</code> atau <code>:q</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menutup sesi REPL (dapat juga menggunakan pintasan <code>Ctrl+C</code> atau <code>Ctrl+D</code>). </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px;"><h4 style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #a855f7; margin: 0 0 10px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-cubes"></i> Kamus Perintah Kompiler CLI (dapcodec) </h4><p style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin: 0 0 12px 0;"> Perintah utilitas kompilasi yang dapat dipanggil langsung dari terminal sistem operasi: </p><div style="overflow-x: auto; max-width: 100%; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4);"><table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 500px;"><thead><tr style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);"><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Perintah Kompiler CLI </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Argumen / Opsi </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Fungsi & Hasil Eksekusi </th><th style="padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; text-align: left; font-size: 12px;"> Contoh Pemanggilan </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec run</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>&lt;berkas.dap&gt;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengeksekusi berkas kode program secara instan (mode JIT). </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec run main.dap</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec test</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>&lt;berkas.dap&gt;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Menjalankan seluruh blok <code>uji { ... }</code> dan mencetak laporan asersi. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec test tes_kalkulator.dap</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec repl</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>(tanpa argumen)</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Membuka konsol Read-Eval-Print Loop interaktif baris per baris. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec repl</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec build</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>-o &lt;output&gt;</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengompilasi kode menjadi binary native (Windows .exe atau Linux ELF). </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec build app.dap -o app.exe</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec wasm</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>--target web</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Mengompilasi menjadi bytecode WebAssembly untuk Web & Mobile PWA. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec wasm game.dap -o game.wasm</code> </td></tr><tr style="transition: background 0.15s;" onmouseover="this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.02)'" onmouseout="this.style.background='transparent'"><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec format</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>--tulis</code> </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> Merestrukturisasi indentasi dan format kode agar rapi dan seragam. </td><td style="padding: 9px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 12px; vertical-align: top;"> <code>dapcodec format main.dap --tulis</code> </td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="dapAiChatTrigger" onclick="toggleDapAiChat()" style="position: fixed; bottom: 24px; right: 24px; z-index: 9999; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 18px; border-radius: 9999px; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13.5px; transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); user-select: none;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-3px) scale(1.03)'; this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 35px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.6)';" onmouseout="this.style.transform='none'; this.style.boxShadow='0 8px 30px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.45)';"><div style="position: relative; width: 22px; height: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles" style="font-size: 16px; animation: pulse 2s infinite;"></i></div><span> Tanya DapCode AI </span><span style="background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25); font-size: 10.5px; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.3px;"> Gemini </span></div><div id="dapAiChatWindow" style="position: fixed; bottom: 85px; right: 24px; width: 440px; max-width: calc(100vw - 32px); height: 600px; max-height: calc(100vh - 110px); background: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.96); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px); border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35); border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), 0 0 40px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); display: none; flex-direction: column; z-index: 10000; overflow: hidden; animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease-out; font-family: inherit;"><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 14px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"><div style="width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i></div><div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><h3 style="font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0;"> DapCode AI </h3><span style="font-size: 9.5px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700;"> 100% Khusus DapCode </span></div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #34d399; display: inline-block;"></span> Didukung Model Google Gemini </div></div></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><button type="button" onclick="toggleDapAiSettings()" title="Pengaturan Gemini API Key" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #94a3b8; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#fff'; this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#94a3b8'; this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.06)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-gear" style="font-size: 13px;"></i></button><button type="button" onclick="clearDapAiHistory()" title="Bersihkan Percakapan" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #94a3b8; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#fff'; this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#94a3b8'; this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.06)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can" style="font-size: 12px;"></i></button><button type="button" onclick="toggleDapAiChat()" title="Tutup Chat" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #94a3b8; width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: all 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#fff'; this.style.background='rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='#94a3b8'; this.style.background='rgba(255,255,255,0.06)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" style="font-size: 14px;"></i></button></div></div><div id="dapAiSettingsDrawer" style="display: none; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.95); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); padding: 14px 18px; font-size: 12px;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 6px;"><label style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-key"></i> Google Gemini API Key </label><a href="https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey" target="_blank" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 11px; text-decoration: underline;"> Dapatkan Kunci Gratis &nearr; </a></div><div style="display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 6px;"><input type="password" id="dapAiApiKeyInput" placeholder="Masukkan AIzaSy... (atau atur di .env)" style="flex: 1; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 10px; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; outline: none;"><button type="button" onclick="saveDapAiApiKey()" style="background: #0284c7; color: #fff; border: none; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11.5px; cursor: pointer;"> Simpan </button></div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.4;"> Kunci disimpan aman di peramban Anda (localStorage). Jika di server sudah dipasang <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code> di .env, input ini bisa dikosongkan. </div><div style="margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 5px;"><label style="color: #38bdf8; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Model Gemini </label><button type="button" id="dapAiCheckModelsBtn" onclick="checkAvailableGeminiModels()" style="background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Cek Model Kunci Saya </button></div><select id="dapAiModelSelect" onchange="saveDapAiModel()" style="width: 100%; background: #0b1329; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px 8px; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 12px; outline: none;"><option value="gemini-3.8-flash"> ✨ Gemini 3.8 Flash (Model DeepMind Terbaru & Terpintar) </option><option value="gemini-2.0-flash" selected> Gemini 2.0 Flash (Stabil, Sangat Cepat & Gratis) </option><option value="auto"> ⚡ Otomatis (Auto-Detect Model Terbaik) </option><option value="gemini-1.5-flash-latest"> Gemini 1.5 Flash (Latest) </option><option value="gemini-1.5-flash"> Gemini 1.5 Flash </option><option value="gemini-1.5-flash-8b"> Gemini 1.5 Flash 8B (Ringan) </option><option value="gemini-1.5-pro"> Gemini 1.5 Pro </option><option value="gemini-pro"> Gemini Pro (1.0) </option></select><div id="dapAiModelHint" style="font-size: 10.5px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 4px;"> Sistem akan otomatis memilih model yang aktif pada API Key Anda jika memilih 'Otomatis'. </div></div></div><div id="dapAiMessagesList" style="flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgba(56,189,248,0.3) transparent;"><div class="dap-ai-msg-bot" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start;"><div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 2px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i></div><div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; border-top-left-radius: 3px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 88%;"> Halo! Saya <strong> DapCode AI </strong> . Saya telah diprogram khusus dengan seluruh spesifikasi bahasa DapCode. <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #94a3b8;"> Tanyakan apa saja seputar sintaksis, pembuatan fungsi, perulangan, I/O, regex, atau penanganan galat di DapCode. </div><div style="margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px;"><button type="button" onclick="sendQuickPrompt('Bagaimana aturan fungsi utama() di DapCode?')" class="dap-ai-chip"> ⚡ Aturan fungsi utama() </button><button type="button" onclick="sendQuickPrompt('Bagaimana cara membaca & menulis file di DapCode?')" class="dap-ai-chip"> 📂 File I/O </button><button type="button" onclick="sendQuickPrompt('Contoh validasi regex nomor HP di DapCode')" class="dap-ai-chip"> 🔍 Validasi Regex </button><button type="button" onclick="sendQuickPrompt('Contoh perulangan koleksi Daftar di DapCode')" class="dap-ai-chip"> 🔁 Perulangan Daftar </button></div></div></div></div><div id="dapAiTypingIndicator" style="display: none; padding: 6px 18px; font-size: 11.5px; color: #38bdf8; background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.4); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> DapCode AI sedang menganalisis &amp; merangkai jawaban... </div><div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-end;"> <textarea id="dapAiChatInput" rows="1" placeholder="Tanyakan seputar DapCode (Enter untuk kirim)..." onkeydown="handleAiChatKeydown(event)" oninput="autoGrowAiTextarea(this)" style="flex: 1; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); border-radius: 10px; padding: 9px 12px; color: #f8fafc; font-size: 12.5px; font-family: inherit; outline: none; resize: none; max-height: 100px; line-height: 1.45; transition: border 0.2s;" onfocus="this.style.borderColor='#38bdf8'" onblur="this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,255,255,0.12)'"></textarea> <button type="button" id="dapAiSendBtn" onclick="sendDapAiMessage()" title="Kirim Pesan" style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); color: #fff; border: none; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 13px; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3); transition: transform 0.15s; flex-shrink: 0;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i></button></div></div><style>.dap-ai-chip{background:rgba(56,189,248,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.25);color:#38bdf8;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;text-align:left;}.dap-ai-chip:hover{background:rgba(56,189,248,0.22);border-color:#38bdf8;color:#fff;}.dap-ai-code-box{background:#030712;border:1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.25);border-radius:8px;margin:8px 0;overflow:hidden;}.dap-ai-code-header{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:5px 10px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:10.5px;color:#94a3b8;}.dap-ai-code-header button{background:transparent;border:none;color:#38bdf8;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;}.dap-ai-code-header button:hover{background:rgba(56,189,248,0.15);color:#fff;}.dap-ai-code-box pre{padding:10px 12px;margin:0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#f8fafc;line-height:1.45;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:thin;}</style><style>.dap-tab-btn{background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--text-muted,#94a3b8);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;transition:all 0.2s ease;}.dap-tab-btn:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);}.dap-tab-btn.active{color:#38bdf8;background:rgba(56,189,248,0.12);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(56,189,248,0.3);}.dap-tab-pane{display:none;animation:fadeIn 0.25s ease-in-out;}.dap-tab-pane.active{display:block;}.dap-two-col,.dap-three-col{width:100%;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;}.dap-two-col > div,.dap-three-col > div{min-width:0 !important;max-width:100% !important;box-sizing:border-box !important;overflow:hidden;}.dap-tab-pane pre{max-width:100% !important;overflow-x:auto !important;box-sizing:border-box !important;white-space:pre;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:rgba(56,189,248,0.4) transparent;}.dap-tab-pane pre::-webkit-scrollbar{height:5px;}.dap-tab-pane pre::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.2);border-radius:4px;}.dap-tab-pane pre::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(56,189,248,0.35);border-radius:4px;}.dap-tab-pane pre::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:rgba(56,189,248,0.65);}.dap-btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(2,132,199,0.6) !important;}@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}@media (max-width:960px){.dap-playground-grid,.dap-two-col,.dap-three-col,.dap-download-grid,.dap-verify-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr !important;}}</style><script>const dapcodeTemplates = { hello: "/// Contoh 1: Halo Dunia & Tipe Data Dasar DapCode\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"============================================\")\n cetak(\"🚀 Selamat datang di DapCode Programming Lang!\")\n cetak(\"============================================\")\n\n nama := \"Pengguna Baru\"\n bahasa := \"DapCode\"\n versi := 0.1\n\n // Interpolasi teks otomatis menggunakan {ekspresi}\n cetak(\"Halo {nama}, selamat mengeksplorasi {bahasa} v{versi}!\")\n\n tahun := 2026\n angka_keberuntungan := 7 * 6\n cetak(\"Tahun rilis: {tahun}, Hasil kali: {angka_keberuntungan}\")\n}", walrus: "/// Contoh 2: Operator Walrus (:=) & Inferensi Tipe Hindley-Milner\nfungsi utama() {\n // Tipe variabel diinferensi otomatis saat kompilasi\n nama_proyek := \"DapCode App\"\n kecepatan_ms := 0.85\n fitur_aktif := benar\n jumlah_modul := 13\n\n cetak(\"Proyek: {nama_proyek}\")\n cetak(\"Kecepatan: {kecepatan_ms} ms\")\n cetak(\"Status Aktif: {fitur_aktif}\")\n cetak(\"Total Modul: {jumlah_modul}\")\n\n total := jumlah_modul * 10\n cetak(\"Kapasitas total sistem: {total} unit\")\n}", error_union: "/// Contoh 3: Error Union (T ! E) & Zero Null-Safety\nfungsi hitung_bagi(pembilang: desimal, penyebut: desimal) -> desimal ! Teks {\n jika penyebut == 0.0 {\n gagal \"Penyebut tidak boleh bernilai nol!\"\n }\n kembali pembilang / penyebut\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"--- Menguji Penanganan Error Union ---\")\n\n // 1. Kasus Sukses\n sukses := hitung_bagi(100.0, 4.0) ? tangkap err {\n cetak(\"Error: {err}\")\n 0.0\n }\n cetak(\"100 / 4 = {sukses}\")\n\n // 2. Kasus Gagal yang Dipulihkan Secara Lokal\n gagal_tertangkap := hitung_bagi(50.0, 0.0) ? tangkap err {\n cetak(\"⚠️ Berhasil menangkap error dengan aman: '{err}'\")\n -1.0\n }\n cetak(\"Hasil setelah pemulihan error: {gagal_tertangkap}\")\n}", struct_trait: "/// Contoh 4: Struktur & Sifat (OOP Modern tanpa Inheritance)\nstruktur Pengguna {\n id: u64\n nama: Teks\n level: Teks\n}\n\nsifat DapatDisapa {\n fungsi sapa(ini) -> Teks\n}\n\nterapkan DapatDisapa untuk Pengguna {\n fungsi sapa(ini) -> Teks {\n kembali \"Salam hormat, {ini.nama}! Akun Anda berada pada level [{ini.level}].\"\n }\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n user := Pengguna(\n id: 101,\n nama: \"Daffa\",\n level: \"Lead Architect\"\n )\n\n cetak(user.sapa())\n}", daftar_loop: "/// Contoh 5: Koleksi Dinamis Daftar & Loop untuk-di\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"--- Demonstrasi Koleksi Dinamis Daftar ---\")\n\n bahasa_list := Daftar()\n bahasa_list.tambah(\"DapCode\")\n bahasa_list.tambah(\"Rust\")\n bahasa_list.tambah(\"PHP\")\n bahasa_list.tambah(\"WebAssembly\")\n\n total := bahasa_list.panjang()\n cetak(\"Total bahasa di daftar: {total}\")\n\n nomor := 1\n untuk bahasa di bahasa_list {\n cetak(\"{nomor}. {bahasa}\")\n nomor = nomor + 1\n }\n}", kamus: "/// Contoh 6: Kamus Key-Value\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"--- Demonstrasi Kamus Key-Value ---\")\n\n profil := Kamus()\n profil.pasang(\"nama\", \"Muhammad Daffa\")\n profil.pasang(\"peran\", \"Pencipta DapCode\")\n profil.pasang(\"domisili\", \"Indonesia\")\n\n nama := profil.ambil_atau(\"nama\", \"-\")\n peran := profil.ambil_atau(\"peran\", \"-\")\n domisili := profil.ambil_atau(\"domisili\", \"-\")\n ada_peran := profil.ada(\"peran\")\n\n cetak(\"Nama: {nama}\")\n cetak(\"Peran: {peran}\")\n cetak(\"Domisili: {domisili}\")\n cetak(\"Apakah ada kunci 'peran': {ada_peran}\")\n}", canvas: "/// Contoh 7: Grafis Kanvas 2D Interaktif\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"Menginisialisasi Kanvas Grafis 2D...\")\n\n lebar := kanvas_lebar()\n tinggi := kanvas_tinggi()\n cetak(\"Dimensi Kanvas: {lebar}x{tinggi}\")\n\n kanvas_bersihkan(0.06, 0.09, 0.16, 1.0)\n kanvas_warna_isi(0.01, 0.52, 0.78, 1.0)\n kanvas_persegi(40.0, 40.0, 220.0, 120.0)\n\n kanvas_warna_isi(0.06, 0.73, 0.51, 1.0)\n kanvas_lingkaran(420.0, 150.0, 65.0)\n\n kanvas_warna_isi(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0)\n kanvas_teks(\"DapCode Canvas 2D Engine\", 50.0, 90.0, 16.0)\n\n kanvas_warna_isi(0.22, 0.74, 0.97, 1.0)\n kanvas_teks(\"Compiled to WebAssembly\", 50.0, 120.0, 13.0)\n\n cetak(\"Kanvas 2D berhasil digambar dengan sukses!\")\n}", json_http: "/// Contoh 8: JSON Serializer & HTTP Client\nstruktur ResponApi {\n status: Teks\n kode: u64\n bahasa: Teks\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"--- Penguraian JSON & Klien HTTP ---\")\n\n data := ResponApi(\n status: \"sukses\",\n kode: 200,\n bahasa: \"DapCode\"\n )\n\n teks_json := ke_json(data)\n cetak(\"Payload JSON: {teks_json}\")\n\n status := ambil_kunci_json(teks_json, \"status\") ? tangkap err { \"gagal\" }\n kode := ambil_angka_json(teks_json, \"kode\") ? tangkap err { 0 }\n bahasa := ambil_kunci_json(teks_json, \"bahasa\") ? tangkap err { \"anonim\" }\n\n cetak(\"Status JSON: {status}\")\n cetak(\"Kode HTTP : {kode}\")\n cetak(\"Bahasa : {bahasa}\")\n}", crypto_regex: "/// Contoh 9: Kriptografi & Regex\nfungsi utama() {\n teks := \"DapCode 2026 Sovereign Language\"\n\n hash_sha := sha256(teks)\n cetak(\"Teks Asli: {teks}\")\n cetak(\"SHA-256 : {hash_sha}\")\n\n b64 := ke_base64(teks)\n cetak(\"Base64 : {b64}\")\n\n apakah_ada_angka := cocok_regex(\"\\\\d+\", teks)\n cetak(\"Mengandung angka: {apakah_ada_angka}\")\n\n teks_sensor := ganti_regex(\"\\\\d+\", teks, \"****\")\n cetak(\"Sensor Angka: {teks_sensor}\")\n}", tests: "/// Contoh 10: Test Runner Mandiri (uji & pastikan)\nfungsi hitung_luas(panjang: u64, lebar: u64) -> u64 {\n kembali panjang * lebar\n}\n\nuji \"menghitung luas persegi panjang dengan benar\" {\n luas := hitung_luas(10, 5)\n pastikan_sama(luas, 50)\n}\n\nuji \"verifikasi luas bujur sangkar sisi 5\" {\n sisi := 5\n luas := hitung_luas(sisi, sisi)\n pastikan_sama(luas, 25)\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"Jalankan suite pengujian menggunakan: dapcodec uji berkas.dap\")\n}", concurrency: "/// Contoh 11: Konkurensi Coroutine Colorless (jalan_paralel & tunggu)\nfungsi tugas_komputasi(id: u64, iterasi: u64) -> u64 {\n cetak(\"Menjalankan tugas #{id}...\")\n total := 0\n i := 1\n selama i <= iterasi {\n total = total + i\n i = i + 1\n }\n kembali total\n}\n\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"Meluncurkan tugas komputasi secara paralel...\")\n\n // Meluncurkan coroutine asinkron\n t1 := jalan_paralel {\n tugas_komputasi(1, 1000)\n }\n t2 := jalan_paralel {\n tugas_komputasi(2, 2000)\n }\n\n // Menunggu dan mensinkronkan hasil tugas\n hasil1 := tunggu(t1)\n hasil2 := tunggu(t2)\n\n cetak(\"Hasil Tugas 1: {hasil1}\")\n cetak(\"Hasil Tugas 2: {hasil2}\")\n cetak(\"Seluruh tugas asinkron selesai disinkronisasi!\")\n}", input_io: "/// Contoh 12: Masukan Interaktif Terminal (masukan & baca_baris)\nfungsi utama() {\n cetak(\"============================================\")\n cetak(\"⌨️ Demonstrasi Input Interaktif DapCode\")\n cetak(\"============================================\")\n\n // Membaca input terminal dengan pesan prompt langsung\n nama := masukan(\"Masukkan nama Anda: \")\n cetak(\"Halo, {nama}! Senang berkenalan dengan Anda.\")\n\n // Membaca baris teks berikutnya\n hobi := masukan(\"Apa bidang keahlian Anda? \")\n cetak(\"Keahlian: [{hobi}]. Siap berkreasi dengan DapCode!\")\n\n cetak(\"Selesai memproses input interaktif.\")\n}", }; function loadDapcodeTemplate(key) { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); const code = dapcodeTemplates[key] || dapcodeTemplates["hello"]; editor.value = code; updateLineNumbers(); const canvasCont = document.getElementById("canvasPreviewContainer"); if (key === "canvas") { canvasCont.style.display = "block"; drawCanvasSimulation(); } else { canvasCont.style.display = "none"; } } function updateLineNumbers() { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); const lineNumbers = document.getElementById("editorLineNumbers"); const stats = document.getElementById("editorStats"); const lines = editor.value.split("\n"); const count = lines.length; let nums = ""; for (let i = 1; i <= count; i++) { nums += i + "\n"; } lineNumbers.innerText = nums; stats.innerText = `Baris: ${count} • Karakter: ${editor.value.length}`; } function handleEditorTab(e) { if (e.key === "Tab") { e.preventDefault(); const editor = e.target; const start = editor.selectionStart; const end = editor.selectionEnd; editor.value = editor.value.substring(0, start) + " " + editor.value.substring(end); editor.selectionStart = editor.selectionEnd = start + 4; updateLineNumbers(); } } function resetEditorCode() { const currentTpl = document.getElementById("templateSelector").value; loadDapcodeTemplate(currentTpl); } function copyEditorCode() { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); navigator.clipboard.writeText(editor.value).then(() => { showToast("Kode DapCode berhasil disalin ke clipboard!"); }); } function copyText(txt) { navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(() => { showToast("Perintah instalasi disalin!"); }); } function downloadEditorCode() { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); const blob = new Blob([editor.value], { type: "text/plain;charset=utf-8" }); const a = document.createElement("a"); a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob); a.download = "program.dap"; a.click(); } function clearTerminal() { cancelInteractiveSession(); document.getElementById("terminalOutput").innerText = "Terminal dibersihkan."; document.getElementById("timingLabel").innerText = "Waktu Eksekusi: -"; document.getElementById("executionBadge").innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#34d399;"></span> Siap Dijalankan`; document.getElementById("executionBadge").style.color = "#34d399"; } function switchDocTab(targetId, btn) { document.querySelectorAll(".dap-tab-btn").forEach(b => b.classList.remove("active")); document.querySelectorAll(".dap-tab-pane").forEach(p => p.classList.remove("active")); btn.classList.add("active"); const target = document.getElementById(targetId); if (target) { target.classList.add("active"); } } function insertSnippet(type) { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); let snippet = ""; switch(type) { case 'fungsi': snippet = `\nfungsi hitung_nilai(x: u64) -> u64 {\n kembali x * 2\n}\n`; break; case 'struktur': snippet = `\nstruktur Produk {\n id: u64,\n nama: Teks,\n harga: desimal\n}\n`; break; case 'error_union': snippet = `\nfungsi operasi_aman() -> u64 ! Teks {\n gagal "Kesalahan terdeteksi"\n}\n`; break; case 'uji': snippet = `\nuji "verifikasi operasi" {\n pastikan_sama(10 + 20, 30)\n}\n`; break; } editor.value += snippet; updateLineNumbers(); editor.scrollTop = editor.scrollHeight; } let activeInteractiveSession = null; function cancelInteractiveSession() { if (activeInteractiveSession) { activeInteractiveSession = null; const bar = document.getElementById("terminalInteractiveBar"); if (bar) bar.style.display = "none"; const btn = document.getElementById("btnRunCode"); if (btn) { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Jalankan Kode (Live Runner)`; } const badge = document.getElementById("executionBadge"); if (badge) { badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;"></span> Dibatalkan`; badge.style.color = "#ef4444"; } const terminal = document.getElementById("terminalOutput"); if (terminal) terminal.innerText += "\n[Sesi input interaktif dibatalkan oleh pengguna.]\n"; } } function submitTerminalInput() { if (!activeInteractiveSession) return; const inputEl = document.getElementById("terminalInteractiveInput"); const val = inputEl ? inputEl.value : ""; const terminal = document.getElementById("terminalOutput"); activeInteractiveSession.inputs.push(val); terminal.innerText += val + "\n"; terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight; activeInteractiveSession.currentPromptIndex++; if (activeInteractiveSession.currentPromptIndex < activeInteractiveSession.prompts.length) { const nextPrompt = activeInteractiveSession.prompts[activeInteractiveSession.currentPromptIndex]; const displayPrompt = nextPrompt || "Ketik masukan berikutnya: "; terminal.innerText += displayPrompt; terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight; const labelEl = document.getElementById("interactivePromptLabel"); if (labelEl) labelEl.innerText = "❯ " + displayPrompt; if (inputEl) { inputEl.value = ""; inputEl.placeholder = "Ketik jawaban lalu tekan [Enter]..."; inputEl.focus(); } } else { const bar = document.getElementById("terminalInteractiveBar"); if (bar) bar.style.display = "none"; const code = activeInteractiveSession.code; const allStdin = activeInteractiveSession.inputs.join("\n") + "\n"; activeInteractiveSession = null; terminal.innerText += "\n[⚡ Mengeksekusi proses DapCode dengan masukan Anda...]\n\n"; terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight; executeCodeOnBackend(code, allStdin); } } async function runDapCode() { const code = document.getElementById("dapEditor").value; const terminal = document.getElementById("terminalOutput"); const badge = document.getElementById("executionBadge"); const btn = document.getElementById("btnRunCode"); if (code.includes("kanvas_bersihkan") || code.includes("kanvas_persegi") || code.includes("kanvas_buat") || code.includes("kanvas_kotak")) { document.getElementById("canvasPreviewContainer").style.display = "block"; drawCanvasSimulation(); } const hasInputFn = /masukan\s*\(/i.test(code) || /baca_baris\s*\(/i.test(code); if (hasInputFn) { const promptRegex = /(?:masukan\s*\(\s*(?:"([^"\\]*(?:\\.[^"\\]*)*)"|'([^'\\]*(?:\\.[^'\\]*)*)')?\s*\)|baca_baris\s*\(\s*\))/g; let match; const prompts = []; while ((match = promptRegex.exec(code)) !== null) { let label = (match[1] || match[2] || "").trim(); prompts.push(label); } if (prompts.length > 0) { btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Menunggu Input...`; badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;animation:pulse 1s infinite alternate;"></span> Menunggu Input (Tekan Enter)`; badge.style.color = "#38bdf8"; const firstPromptPos = code.search(/(?:masukan|baca_baris)\s*\(/); const preCode = firstPromptPos > -1 ? code.substring(0, firstPromptPos) : ""; const cetakRegex = /cetak\s*\(\s*(?:"([^"\\]*(?:\\.[^"\\]*)*)"|'([^'\\]*(?:\\.[^'\\]*)*)')\s*\)/g; let cMatch; let initialOutput = ""; while ((cMatch = cetakRegex.exec(preCode)) !== null) { let txt = (cMatch[1] || cMatch[2] || "").replace(/\\n/g, "\n").replace(/\\t/g, "\t"); initialOutput += txt + "\n"; } if (!initialOutput) { initialOutput = "=== [DapCode Interactive Console] ===\nProgram sedang berjalan...\n\n"; } terminal.innerText = initialOutput + (prompts[0] || "Ketik masukan: "); terminal.scrollTop = terminal.scrollHeight; activeInteractiveSession = { code: code, prompts: prompts, currentPromptIndex: 0, inputs: [] }; const bar = document.getElementById("terminalInteractiveBar"); const labelEl = document.getElementById("interactivePromptLabel"); const inputEl = document.getElementById("terminalInteractiveInput"); if (labelEl) labelEl.innerText = "❯ " + (prompts[0] || "Ketik masukan: "); if (inputEl) { inputEl.value = ""; inputEl.placeholder = "Ketik jawaban lalu tekan [Enter]..."; } if (bar) { bar.style.display = "flex"; } setTimeout(() => { if (inputEl) inputEl.focus(); }, 60); return; } } executeCodeOnBackend(code, ""); } async function executeCodeOnBackend(code, stdinVal) { const terminal = document.getElementById("terminalOutput"); const badge = document.getElementById("executionBadge"); const timing = document.getElementById("timingLabel"); const btn = document.getElementById("btnRunCode"); btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Mengeksekusi...`; badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;"></span> Sedang Berjalan...`; badge.style.color = "#f59e0b"; const tStart = performance.now(); try { const response = await fetch("{{ url('/project/dapcode-lang/execute') }}", { method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", "X-CSRF-TOKEN": "{{ csrf_token() }}", "Accept": "application/json" }, body: JSON.stringify({ code: code, stdin: stdinVal }) }); if (response.ok) { const result = await response.json(); const elapsed = result.duration_ms || Math.round(performance.now() - tStart); terminal.innerText = result.output || "(Program selesai tanpa output teks)"; timing.innerText = `Waktu Eksekusi: ${elapsed} ms • Exit Code: ${result.exit_code}`; if (result.success) { badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#34d399;"></span> Sukses (0)`; badge.style.color = "#34d399"; } else { badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;"></span> Gagal (${result.exit_code})`; badge.style.color = "#ef4444"; } } else { const fallbackOutput = simulateDapCodeInBrowser(code, stdinVal); const elapsed = Math.round(performance.now() - tStart); terminal.innerText = `[Simulator Web Browser]\n` + fallbackOutput; timing.innerText = `Waktu Eksekusi: ${elapsed} ms (Client Simulation)`; badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;"></span> Sukses (Web Simulator)`; badge.style.color = "#38bdf8"; } } catch (e) { const fallbackOutput = simulateDapCodeInBrowser(code, stdinVal); const elapsed = Math.round(performance.now() - tStart); terminal.innerText = `[Simulator Web Browser]\n` + fallbackOutput; timing.innerText = `Waktu Eksekusi: ${elapsed} ms (Client Simulation)`; badge.innerHTML = `<span style="width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#38bdf8;"></span> Sukses (Web Simulator)`; badge.style.color = "#38bdf8"; } finally { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Jalankan Kode (Live Runner)`; } } function simulateDapCodeInBrowser(code, stdinVal = "") { let outputLines = []; const lines = code.split("\n"); let vars = {}; let stdinQueue = (stdinVal || "").split("\n").filter(s => s.trim() !== ""); for (let rawLine of lines) { let line = rawLine.trim(); if (line.startsWith("//") || line.startsWith("///") || line === "") continue; if (line.includes(":=")) { let parts = line.split(":="); let vName = parts[0].trim(); let vVal = parts[1].trim().replace(/;$/, ""); if (vVal.includes("masukan(") || vVal.includes("baca_baris(")) { let promptMatch = vVal.match(/masukan\s*\(\s*["'](.*?)["']/); let pText = promptMatch ? promptMatch[1] : ""; let entered = stdinQueue.length > 0 ? stdinQueue.shift() : "DapCode User"; if (pText) { outputLines.push(pText + entered); } vars[vName] = entered; } else if (vVal.startsWith('"') && vVal.endsWith('"')) { vars[vName] = vVal.slice(1, -1); } else { try { vars[vName] = eval(vVal); } catch(e) { vars[vName] = vVal; } } } if (line.startsWith("cetak(") && line.endsWith(")")) { let content = line.substring(6, line.length - 1).trim(); if (content.startsWith('"') && content.endsWith('"')) { let inner = content.slice(1, -1); inner = inner.replace(/\{([a-zA-Z0-9_]+)\}/g, function(match, p1) { return vars[p1] !== undefined ? vars[p1] : match; }); outputLines.push(inner); } else { outputLines.push(vars[content] !== undefined ? vars[content] : content); } } if (line.startsWith('uji "') || line.startsWith("uji '")) { let testName = line.match(/uji\s+["'](.*?)["']/); if (testName && testName[1]) { outputLines.push(` uji "${testName[1]}" ... ok`); } } } if (outputLines.length === 0) { return "Program DapCode berhasil dikompilasi (0 kesalahan)."; } return outputLines.join("\n"); } function drawCanvasSimulation() { const canvas = document.getElementById("dapCanvas"); if (!canvas) return; const ctx = canvas.getContext("2d"); ctx.fillStyle = "#0f172a"; ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height); ctx.strokeStyle = "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)"; ctx.lineWidth = 1; for (let x = 0; x < canvas.width; x += 30) { ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x, 0); ctx.lineTo(x, canvas.height); ctx.stroke(); } for (let y = 0; y < canvas.height; y += 30) { ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, y); ctx.lineTo(canvas.width, y); ctx.stroke(); } ctx.fillStyle = "#0284c7"; ctx.shadowColor = "rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.5)"; ctx.shadowBlur = 12; ctx.fillRect(40, 50, 240, 130); ctx.beginPath(); ctx.fillStyle = "#10b981"; ctx.shadowColor = "rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6)"; ctx.shadowBlur = 16; ctx.arc(430, 150, 70, 0, Math.PI * 2); ctx.fill(); ctx.shadowBlur = 0; ctx.fillStyle = "#ffffff"; ctx.font = "bold 18px 'Outfit', sans-serif"; ctx.fillText("DapCode Canvas 2D Engine", 55, 105); ctx.fillStyle = "#bae6fd"; ctx.font = "13px 'JetBrains Mono', monospace"; ctx.fillText("Compiled to WebAssembly (.wasm)", 55, 135); } function showToast(msg) { let toast = document.getElementById("dapToast"); if (!toast) { toast = document.createElement("div"); toast.id = "dapToast"; toast.style.position = "fixed"; toast.style.bottom = "84px"; toast.style.right = "24px"; toast.style.background = "rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95)"; toast.style.border = "1px solid #38bdf8"; toast.style.color = "#fff"; toast.style.padding = "10px 18px"; toast.style.borderRadius = "8px"; toast.style.fontSize = "13px"; toast.style.fontWeight = "600"; toast.style.boxShadow = "0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)"; toast.style.zIndex = "9999"; toast.style.transition = "opacity 0.3s ease"; document.body.appendChild(toast); } toast.innerText = msg; toast.style.opacity = "1"; setTimeout(() => { toast.style.opacity = "0"; }, 2800); } function loadSnippetToPlayground(code) { const editor = document.getElementById("dapEditor"); if (editor) { editor.value = code; updateLineNumbers(); editor.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth", block: "center" }); showNotificationToast("Kode contoh berhasil dimuat ke editor!"); } } function filterDocTopics(query) { const q = (query || "").toLowerCase().trim(); const docPanes = document.querySelectorAll(".doc-section"); if (!q) { docPanes.forEach(p => { p.querySelectorAll("div, tr, p").forEach(el => el.style.display = ""); }); return; } const activePane = document.querySelector(".dap-tab-pane.active"); if (activePane) { const textElements = activePane.querySelectorAll("div, p, tr"); textElements.forEach(el => { if (el.children.length === 0 || el.tagName === "TR") { const match = el.innerText.toLowerCase().includes(q); } }); } } function showNotificationToast(msg) { let toast = document.getElementById("dapDocToast"); if (!toast) { toast = document.createElement("div"); toast.id = "dapDocToast"; toast.style.position = "fixed"; toast.style.bottom = "84px"; toast.style.right = "24px"; toast.style.background = "#0284c7"; toast.style.color = "#fff"; toast.style.padding = "10px 18px"; toast.style.borderRadius = "8px"; toast.style.fontSize = "13px"; toast.style.fontWeight = "600"; toast.style.boxShadow = "0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.5)"; toast.style.zIndex = "99999"; toast.style.transition = "all 0.3s ease"; document.body.appendChild(toast); } toast.innerText = msg; toast.style.opacity = "1"; toast.style.transform = "translateY(0)"; setTimeout(() => { toast.style.opacity = "0"; toast.style.transform = "translateY(10px)"; }, 2500); } let dapAiHistory = []; let dapAiIsOpen = false; function toggleDapAiChat() { const win = document.getElementById("dapAiChatWindow"); if (!win) return; dapAiIsOpen = !dapAiIsOpen; win.style.display = dapAiIsOpen ? "flex" : "none"; if (dapAiIsOpen) { const storedKey = localStorage.getItem("dapcode_gemini_api_key"); const keyInput = document.getElementById("dapAiApiKeyInput"); if (storedKey && keyInput) { keyInput.value = storedKey; } let storedModel = localStorage.getItem("dapcode_gemini_model") || "gemini-2.0-flash"; if (storedModel.includes("image") || storedModel.includes("preview-image")) { storedModel = "gemini-2.0-flash"; localStorage.setItem("dapcode_gemini_model", storedModel); } const modelSelect = document.getElementById("dapAiModelSelect"); if (modelSelect) { modelSelect.value = storedModel; } setTimeout(() => { const input = document.getElementById("dapAiChatInput"); if (input) input.focus(); }, 100); } } function toggleDapAiSettings() { const drawer = document.getElementById("dapAiSettingsDrawer"); if (!drawer) return; drawer.style.display = (drawer.style.display === "none" || !drawer.style.display) ? "block" : "none"; } function saveDapAiApiKey() { const input = document.getElementById("dapAiApiKeyInput"); if (!input) return; const key = input.value.trim(); if (key) { localStorage.setItem("dapcode_gemini_api_key", key); showNotificationToast("Gemini API Key berhasil disimpan!"); checkAvailableGeminiModels(); } else { localStorage.removeItem("dapcode_gemini_api_key"); showNotificationToast("Gemini API Key dihapus (menggunakan .env server)"); } } function saveDapAiModel() { const modelSelect = document.getElementById("dapAiModelSelect"); if (!modelSelect) return; const model = modelSelect.value; localStorage.setItem("dapcode_gemini_model", model); showNotificationToast(`Model AI diatur ke: ${model}`); } async function checkAvailableGeminiModels() { const btn = document.getElementById("dapAiCheckModelsBtn"); const hint = document.getElementById("dapAiModelHint"); const modelSelect = document.getElementById("dapAiModelSelect"); const storedApiKey = localStorage.getItem("dapcode_gemini_api_key") || ""; if (btn) { btn.disabled = true; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Memeriksa...`; } try { const resp = await fetch("{{ url('/project/dapcode-lang/models') }}", { method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", "X-CSRF-TOKEN": "{{ csrf_token() }}", "Accept": "application/json" }, body: JSON.stringify({ api_key: storedApiKey }) }); const data = await resp.json(); if (data.success && Array.isArray(data.models) && data.models.length > 0) { const currentVal = modelSelect.value; modelSelect.innerHTML = `<option value="auto">⚡ Otomatis (${data.recommended} direkomendasikan)</option>`; data.models.forEach(m => { const opt = document.createElement("option"); opt.value = m; opt.innerText = m; modelSelect.appendChild(opt); }); if (currentVal && Array.from(modelSelect.options).some(o => o.value === currentVal)) { modelSelect.value = currentVal; } else { modelSelect.value = "auto"; } if (hint) { hint.innerText = `Ditemukan ${data.models.length} model aktif untuk kunci Anda. Model terbaik: ${data.recommended}`; hint.style.color = "#34d399"; } showNotificationToast(`Ditemukan ${data.models.length} model aktif!`); } else { if (hint) { hint.innerText = data.message || "Tidak dapat memuat model, menggunakan fallback default."; hint.style.color = "#f87171"; } } } catch (e) { if (hint) { hint.innerText = "Gagal menghubungi server untuk cek model."; hint.style.color = "#f87171"; } } finally { if (btn) { btn.disabled = false; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i> Cek Model Kunci Saya`; } } } function clearDapAiHistory() { dapAiHistory = []; const list = document.getElementById("dapAiMessagesList"); if (list) { const welcome = list.querySelector(".dap-ai-msg-bot"); list.innerHTML = ""; if (welcome) list.appendChild(welcome); } showNotificationToast("Riwayat obrolan AI dibersihkan."); } function autoGrowAiTextarea(el) { el.style.height = "auto"; el.style.height = (el.scrollHeight) + "px"; } function handleAiChatKeydown(e) { if (e.key === "Enter" && !e.shiftKey) { e.preventDefault(); sendDapAiMessage(); } } function sendQuickPrompt(promptText) { const input = document.getElementById("dapAiChatInput"); if (input) { input.value = promptText; sendDapAiMessage(); } } function copyAiCode(btn) { const codeEl = btn.closest(".dap-ai-code-box").querySelector("code"); if (!codeEl) return; navigator.clipboard.writeText(codeEl.innerText).then(() => { const origText = btn.innerHTML; btn.innerHTML = `<i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Tersalin!`; btn.style.color = "#34d399"; setTimeout(() => { btn.innerHTML = origText; btn.style.color = "#38bdf8"; }, 2000); }); } function formatAiMarkdown(text) { if (!text) return ""; let escaped = text .replace(/&/g, "&amp;") .replace(/</g, "&lt;") .replace(/>/g, "&gt;"); escaped = escaped.replace(/```(?:dapcode|dap)?\s*([\s\S]*?)```/g, function(match, code) { return `<div class="dap-ai-code-box"><div class="dap-ai-code-header"><span><i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> DapCode</span><div style="display:flex; gap:8px;"><button type="button" onclick="copyAiCode(this)"><i class="fa-regular fa-copy"></i> Salin</button><button type="button" onclick="loadSnippetToPlayground(this.closest('.dap-ai-code-box').querySelector('code').innerText.trim())"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> Coba di Playground</button></div></div> <pre><code>${code.trim()}</code></pre> </div>`; }); escaped = escaped.replace(/`([^`]+)`/g, '<code style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);color:#38bdf8;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-family:monospace;font-size:11.5px;">$1</code>'); escaped = escaped.replace(/\*\*([^*]+)\*\*/g, '<strong style="color:#f8fafc;">$1</strong>'); escaped = escaped.replace(/^[*-]\s+(.+)$/gm, '<li style="margin-left:14px; margin-bottom: 3px;">$1</li>'); escaped = escaped.replace(/\n\n/g, '<div style="height:8px;"></div>'); escaped = escaped.replace(/\n/g, '<br>'); return escaped; } async function sendDapAiMessage() { const input = document.getElementById("dapAiChatInput"); const sendBtn = document.getElementById("dapAiSendBtn"); const list = document.getElementById("dapAiMessagesList"); const typing = document.getElementById("dapAiTypingIndicator"); const message = input.value.trim(); if (!message) return; input.value = ""; input.style.height = "auto"; sendBtn.disabled = true; const userMsgEl = document.createElement("div"); userMsgEl.style.display = "flex"; userMsgEl.style.justifyContent = "flex-end"; userMsgEl.innerHTML = ` <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #0369a1); color: #fff; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border-top-right-radius: 3px; font-size: 12.5px; max-width: 85%; line-height: 1.45; word-break: break-word; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(2,132,199,0.3);"> ${message.replace(/&/g, "&amp;").replace(/</g, "&lt;").replace(/>/g, "&gt;").replace(/\n/g, "<br>")} </div> `; list.appendChild(userMsgEl); list.scrollTop = list.scrollHeight; if (typing) typing.style.display = "flex"; const storedApiKey = localStorage.getItem("dapcode_gemini_api_key") || ""; let storedModel = localStorage.getItem("dapcode_gemini_model") || "gemini-2.0-flash"; if (storedModel.includes("image") || storedModel.includes("preview-image")) { storedModel = "gemini-2.0-flash"; localStorage.setItem("dapcode_gemini_model", storedModel); } try { const response = await fetch("{{ url('/project/dapcode-lang/chat') }}", { method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", "X-CSRF-TOKEN": "{{ csrf_token() }}", "Accept": "application/json" }, body: JSON.stringify({ message: message, history: dapAiHistory, api_key: storedApiKey, model: storedModel }) }); const data = await response.json(); if (typing) typing.style.display = "none"; const botReply = data.reply || (data.error ? "Terjadi kesalahan: " + data.error : "Tidak ada respon."); const modelBadge = data.model_used ? `<span style="font-size: 9.5px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.12); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 6px;">${data.model_used}</span>` : ""; const botMsgEl = document.createElement("div"); botMsgEl.className = "dap-ai-msg-bot"; botMsgEl.style.display = "flex"; botMsgEl.style.gap = "10px"; botMsgEl.style.alignItems = "flex-start"; botMsgEl.innerHTML = ` <div style="width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2); color: #38bdf8; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 2px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i></div><div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; border-top-left-radius: 3px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 12.5px; color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 88%; word-break: break-word;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;"><span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #f8fafc;">DapCode AI</span> ${modelBadge} </div> ${formatAiMarkdown(botReply)} </div> `; list.appendChild(botMsgEl); list.scrollTop = list.scrollHeight; if (data.success) { dapAiHistory.push({ role: "user", content: message }); dapAiHistory.push({ role: "assistant", content: botReply }); if (dapAiHistory.length > 20) { dapAiHistory = dapAiHistory.slice(-20); } } if (data.needs_key) { const drawer = document.getElementById("dapAiSettingsDrawer"); if (drawer) drawer.style.display = "block"; } } catch (err) { if (typing) typing.style.display = "none"; const errEl = document.createElement("div"); errEl.innerHTML = `<div style="background: rgba(239,68,68,0.15); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3); color: #fca5a5; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px;">Terjadi kesalahan jaringan: ${err.message}</div>`; list.appendChild(errEl); list.scrollTop = list.scrollHeight; } finally { sendBtn.disabled = false; setTimeout(() => { if (input) input.focus(); }, 50); } }</script>